WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:01.500
'I was the one who accompanied.'

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.190
'The person who asked me
to leave you there'

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.750
'and asked me to let you go
was my father.'

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.250
'Why don't we steal
Dr. Radhi's phone?'

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.630
'You want his number, right?'

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.380
'You could have asked me.'

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.450
'Radhi should leave
this hospital for good.'

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.290
'She shouldn't come back
for any reason.'

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.260
'Let's do it as a team together.'

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.040
'Mom, get up..'

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.590
'Not everyone
is so fortunate, Guna.'

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.330
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.800
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.380
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:04.500
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:07.050
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:09.820
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.380
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:17.590
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:22.700
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:29.040
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.880
Reena, why are you looking
at them removing the decoration?

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:56.450
It's nothing, Teju.

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.960
We have seen so many patients
since we joined here as interns.

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:05.370
Losing them or saving them
isn't new to us.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:09.670
But some patients
connect with us, right?

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:15.250
They leave a mark on us.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.440
It has a huge impact on us.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.380
Maybe it's because she's Guna's
mother that you feel that way.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.790
Not just that, Teju.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.860
Everyone is going to die one day.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.650
But we don't know
when that will be.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:40.140
But Guna's mother was living
with a countdown to her death.

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:45.130
But not a single day did
she cries because of that.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.540
She handled
everything with a smile.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.310
Not everyone can do that.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.490
But one thing is for sure.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:03.350
On the day of the death, we
have to handle death with boldness.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.420
How is Guna?

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:14.380
I think it will take time for him
to process all this and come out.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:19.220
It will take him some time
to come back to the hospital.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.260
Why are you packing
so hastily, Dev?

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:25.590
Why all of a sudden?

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.210
All of a sudden?

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.080
The reason I'm here is because
of the kids. But you're right.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.520
The kids know everything.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.000
They understand what's going
on between us and who Reena is.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.030
So they'll understand
why I'm leaving now.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.250
Dev, you know that I have a past.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:43.260
I will tell you what happened.
Let's sit down and talk.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.690
But you're being adamant
and wouldn't listen to me.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.370
Why?

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.930
Can't you just let go of my past?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.090
Who doesn't have a past?

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.380
I can't change what happened.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.840
But I'm trying to fix it.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.090
You're right.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:05.630
You can't change the past.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.210
But what if this had
happened to me?

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.760
What if I had a son
or a daughter like Reena?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.790
Would you be able
to live with that?

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:17.790
On top of that, she lives right
next to us and visits us every day.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.500
Would you have accepted that?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:20.980
You can't, right?

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:22.270
I feel the same way.

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:31.340
So what's the solution to this?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.080
Let's not complicate it
and just break up.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:35.450
Dev.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.430
Think about our kids.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:39.000
They will be with me.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.030
How can they be with you?

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.600
Because I'll take care of them.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.790
Won't I take care of them?

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.080
Why are you talking
as if you have all the rights?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.250
Fine.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.290
Let's see. Tell me what classes
they go to, after school.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.540
You've been with the kids
for a few months, right?

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:57.170
You take Divi
to her swimming classes.

00:04:57.350 --> 00:04:58.980
Do you know which class
she goes to after that?

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.780
Do you know when was
Sid's last football match?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.480
Do you know how
much their school fees are?

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.600
I don't know anything, Dev.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.310
I didn't worry about it
because you were here.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:13.920
Shall I tell you the truth?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.130
You can't take care of it
when I'm not here.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.310
It doesn't mean I'm not a mother.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.130
I'm not saying no, but
it's important to know such things.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.110
Dad!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.140
Divi, don't ask me anything.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.830
I'm leaving now.
But I'll come back to take you.

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:39.410
Dev.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.690
I won't give up the kids
no matter how hard you try.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.350
I'll take care of them
even if you're not here.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.230
You can't do that, Radhi.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:49.660
The example is Reena.

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:01.200
Rocky, Mr. Arjun
has called for you.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.000
Mr. Arjun?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.400
He doesn't talk to me.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.080
He asked you to come to his cabin.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.890
Are you sure?
It might be somebody else.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:13.340
He said you'd be in
the interns' room or the canteen.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:14.500
He asked you to come.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.170
Oh! Is that what he said?

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.790
Yes, that's what he said.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.620
Tell him that I'm busy in the ER,
and that I'll see him in 10 minutes.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.580
No, I'll go and tell him.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.710
I don't know why he
asked me to come.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:36.840
Mr. Arjun.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.670
They said you wanted to see me.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.380
Are you mocking me?

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.050
I want to talk
about something personally.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:47.810
Personal? I thought
I was in trouble.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:51.170
Okay, tell me. What do you
want to talk about?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:56.600
I heard that you crashed
your car on a DUI accident.

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:57.880
The car is safe, right?

00:06:58.780 --> 00:06:59.730
Hey!

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.750
I want to talk to you
casually as the CEO.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:08.170
Tell me, bro.
About what?

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:13.970
About Reena.
- That's right.

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.000
It's not like you'd talk to me
about the hospital.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.370
Tell me, what's the matter?

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:22.220
What's going on
between Reena and Kiran?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.400
What's going on
between Reena and Kiran?

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.110
They work together.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:31.980
They go out often.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.810
Oh! They went on a date
to a tea shop.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.960
He has really impressed her.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.560
He is like Reena.
He doesn't spend money.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:43.160
Minus cross minus is plus.
It's a big advantage for him.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:47.980
But..

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:51.250
Despite all this,
there is nothing between them.

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:53.280
Hey!

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.500
I am talking seriously.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.250
Then, what is this?

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:00.290
You are asking me
why they are talking to each other.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:02.880
Why? Don't you know about Reena?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:09.610
She should have hated you
for what you said about her.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.410
Anyone would have done the same
if they were in her shoes.

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:14.650
Despite all that anger

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.500
at least she is talking to you.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.080
After that incident

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:25.710
she didn't say a single word to
anyone about what you did to her.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.230
The way she respects
people is different.

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.400
Poor thing!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.540
But no one treats her like that.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:36.340
I feel that you have lost it
in the process of becoming the CEO.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.170
Are you saying
that I have lost Reena?

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.420
No, you have lost yourself.

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:44.790
I don't understand.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.260
Bro, back then..

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.000
Whenever you came to meet Reena

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.910
you used to wear
baggy T-shirts and earrings.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.080
You used to look stylish.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:57.060
But look at you now.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:58.840
Hey!

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:01.400
I am the CEO of that hospital.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.030
That's what I am trying to say.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.200
You are always in formals.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.020
Even when you talk,
you talk formally.

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:09.920
When we have a conversation,
at least ten times you go..

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.750
"Hey, I am the CEO."

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:12.940
Oh no!

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:17.390
I don't know if it's because Reena
asked if you were Batman

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.750
but your voice
does sound like Batman.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.120
Don't be so uptight, bro.

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:25.860
Why do you always
look like a rigid soldier?

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:27.640
Hey!

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.710
What is the connection
between the two?

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.010
There is a connection, bro.

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:35.920
Earlier, Reena used to share
a lot of things with you.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.850
Is she doing anything like that
now? Do you have that friendship?

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.630
You don't, right?
- No.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.500
You hold such a big position now.

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.540
So she might be afraid
of what people would think.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:50.350
You should make her understand
that you don't care about it.

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.080
Rocky, what should I do for that?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.920
Great.
Do I have to say that too?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.420
Bro, do whatever Reena likes.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.380
She will say that
she doesn't like it first.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.380
Slowly, she will accept it.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:04.880
And you as well.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.090
Think about it.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:08.830
Bye, bro.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:20.920
What happened?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.760
I don't know what happened, Doctor.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.680
Usually, she gets tired
after work and goes to sleep.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:28.000
She'd wake up
in two to three hours.

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:30.540
She woke up today, but..

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.360
She doesn't talk or move.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.830
I don't know what happened, Doctor.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.130
She is conscious.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.680
Sir, did she have any
health problem before this?

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:41.670
I don't know if it's
a health problem, Doctor.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.460
But she has mood swings.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.500
She'd get angry suddenly
and calm down right after.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:49.250
She'd sleep no matter where it is.

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:51.660
She is very unpredictable, Doctor.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:54.870
Sir, this doesn't look
like mood swings.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.000
Did you check
in any other hospital?

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.710
Once, she got angry and fainted.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:04.280
So we went to a hospital.
But she became alright there.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:07.430
So, they told me to take her back.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:11.090
But whenever I tell her
that I'd take her to a hospital

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:14.210
she gets agitated.
She'd throw whatever she gets.

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:18.380
But for the first time,
she is silent like this.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:22.000
Is there any other problem
in her eyes or ears?

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:23.420
Nothing like that, Doctor.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.630
She is taking anxiety pills.
It's a doctor's prescription.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.000
That's all.

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.720
How long has she been in bed?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.400
It's been four days, Doctor.

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:35.790
I took her to different hospitals.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.450
My friend told me
to bring her here. That's why..

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.880
We will try to figure
out this problem, sir.

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:44.410
Don't worry. We will do our best.
- Thank you, Doctor.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.000
Reena.
- Yes, sir.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:51.460
Reena. I need a CBC.
- Sir.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:53.960
Sir, what could be the issue?

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:55.980
What is there to assume, Reena?

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:57.330
All we need is facts.

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.680
Let us get the test results.
We will see after that. Okay?

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:01.590
Sure, sir.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:07.250
Hi, Manasa.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.460
Hi, Anitha.

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:12.170
Come in.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:15.770
Thank you.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:17.790
Tell me.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.600
It's nothing much.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:24.350
Everyone in this hospital asked me
to take counselling from you.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:27.180
That's why I came.
- That's good.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.020
You can feel like you
got a break from work.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:33.600
And..

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.860
Think of me as your friend
and talk to me.

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.780
There is nothing to talk about.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:41.250
I am always busy with work.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:46.670
Guna's mother died recently.
It's a bit difficult for me.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:47.850
Oh.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.500
I am sorry.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.270
It's okay.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:55.500
Guna became close to his mother
over the last few months.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:59.270
His mother's death
would have affected him a lot.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.920
Okay. Forget about his life.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:07.100
Talk about your life.
What are your parents doing?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.400
My parents are settled in the US.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:14.120
I like this city,
my friends and this hospital.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.540
I didn't want to leave this place.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:17.950
That's why I stayed here.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.220
You must have a lot of friends.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:22.730
Very few.
There are only three of us.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.710
Dr. Ravi was working
in this hospital.

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:27.790
We have been friends
since childhood.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:29.630
And Arjun..

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:31.400
Mr. Arjun.

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:34.790
He is the CEO now.
We have been friends since college.

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:40.710
Oh, interesting.
Are you classmates?

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.710
Yes. It's so much fun when
the three of us get together.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.740
We don't know how time flies.

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:48.750
But Arjun got busy
after he became the CEO.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.490
Ravi also left for the US.

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:54.740
So everyone is busy
with their own work.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:57.880
Anitha.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:02.170
By the way, how long have you
been working in this hospital?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.380
You have my profile
but you are still asking me.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:10.500
I mean, based on your experience

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:13.000
I thought you'd be
in a higher position

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:15.040
like Dr. Radhi or Dr. Preetham.

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:20.500
Surprisingly you are more of
an assistant than a lead surgeon.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:21.840
That's why.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:31.420
I mean.. I teach interns.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:32.660
So..

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:37.830
Even your juniors have assisted
more surgeries than you.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:44.650
Do you need more practice? Or..

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.250
Are you not interested?

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.920
My career is more important
than the profile that you have.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:53.130
I didn't mean that.

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.560
Based on your profile

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:59.130
I think a doctor
with potential like you

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.100
is being underused by this hospital.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.340
Why are you telling me this now?

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.340
I wanted to tell you
as your friend.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.000
Do you have something to say to me?

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.000
You have to tell me.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.340
I'm sorry. I don't, thank you.

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:27.880
Hello, sir.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.170
Have you started your work?

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:41.830
Why do you worry about that, sir?
Sit down.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.070
You said you will help me
regarding Radhi.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:46.540
You didn't do anything.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.590
Even when I try to do something

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:52.460
Arjun ruins it.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.210
Is that it?

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:59.170
Use your power and shift
Reena and your case to Radhi.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:00.490
Don't I know that?

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:04.880
After Ganga's case, Arjun won't
allow them to work together.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.100
He knows that they fight a lot.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.960
Then think about
how to convince him.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:15.760
If you use Arjun wisely,
whatever you want will happen.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.900
And one more thing. Even if
there is a problem tomorrow..

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:20.500
It will fall on Arjun.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.040
You will be safe.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:30.500
Where is she?

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.090
Amaya.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:40.960
Tell me, Doctor.
- You danced really great.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.790
But you weren't there.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.100
Rocky showed me on the phone.
It was great.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:51.510
I didn't expect this from you.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:55.020
Why? Can't I dance?
- Not like that.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:58.470
I was surprised
at how talented you are.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.570
You looked beautiful too.

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.830
How is your health now?

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:12.540
It's fine.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:14.620
Take medicines properly.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:17.540
Tell me if you have any tests to run.
I will take care of it.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:18.790
Okay.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.250
Amaya.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.750
I want to tell you something.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.080
Don't get angry.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.530
I wasn't angry
when you spoke about Dr. Preetham.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.590
I wasn't angry
when you spoke about Dr. Radhi.

00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:42.120
I wasn't angry
when you spoke about everyone here.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:45.150
What are you going to say now
that will make me angry?

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:46.880
Not like that.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:48.960
What I have spoken so far is different.

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:51.590
What I'm going
to say now is different.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.500
Oh.
- Shall I say it?

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.590
Tell me.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.730
Amaya, I like you a lot.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:04.960
That's it?

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:06.210
What's the big deal?

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.880
No, I didn't mean what you think.

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:11.540
I meant that..

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:16.710
Amaya, I am interested in you.

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:24.210
You know
that I can't hide anything.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.910
And I'm used
to telling you everything.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.150
So I confessed this too.

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:31.000
Please don't..
- Doctor.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.540
What is it?
- The patient

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.800
in room 403 is adamant that he'll
take the pills only if you come.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.770
Why is that guy doing this now?

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:40.420
You go. I will come.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:45.210
I will.. be right back.

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.170
Arjun.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:00.990
Come, sir.

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:02.230
Are you busy, Arjun?

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.770
No. It's okay, sir, tell me.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.170
I have decided something.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.210
What is it, sir?

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.850
There is a new case.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.170
The patient's name is Meena.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.580
She is admitted to a private ward.

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.250
Okay.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:22.470
I feel it will be good
if Radhi handles that case.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:28.490
You had a problem with her
handling your case.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.130
Correct, Arjun.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:32.820
We fight only when
it comes to a patient.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.730
When I thought about it

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:37.270
I understood something.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.310
Why should I fight with her?

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:41.510
I am the chief doctor
of RK Hospital.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:46.080
It is a chief doctor's job to get
work done by smart people like her.

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:50.340
So I think Radhi
is the perfect person for this.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:54.090
Also, I am very busy with
management affairs and meetings.

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:57.170
But this is not
Dr. Radhi's expertise.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.500
What are you saying, Arjun?

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:02.210
The twin baby's case..
Narmada's case..

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:05.050
And the problem with the nurses..
She was great with those.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.110
How can you say
she's not an expert?

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.790
Sir.
- Come in, Aruna.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:16.170
Sir, Dr. Radhi asked me
to give this to you.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:17.710
Thank you, Aruna.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.170
Okay, sir.

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:20.540
Aruna.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.090
Wait for a minute.

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:28.750
We have to arrange the details
in these files alphabetically.

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.210
Can you do that?

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:31.460
Okay, sir.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:33.490
Tell me, sir.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.770
You were talking about
some problems with the nurses.

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:40.420
She has sorted everything out well.

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:44.840
So, I think
Radhi is the right choice.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.750
As a chief doctor,
this is my decision.

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:52.960
Okay, sir.

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:55.460
As the chief doctor,
you have said it.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:56.840
I have to listen to it.

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:59.840
And one more thing.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:04.040
Allocate Reena to this case.

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:06.290
Why, sir?

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:11.290
Arjun, isn't it better for two
talented people to work together?

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:14.920
What are you saying, sir?
All the doctors here are talented.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.130
Why? She can work under you.

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:18.340
See, Arjun.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.690
Naveen and Kamal
are working under me.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:23.450
Guna hasn't come to the hospital
since his mother died.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:27.170
Plus, Anitha is fully
occupied with the wardroom.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.410
So, Reena is the right choice.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:33.420
If she works on a complicated case
like this, isn't it good for her?

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:36.960
'Bro, do what Reena likes.'

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.110
'She'd say that she
doesn’t like it first.'

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:42.040
'But slowly, she will accept it.
And you as well.'

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:46.250
Okay, sir.

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.730
As you said,
let Dr. Radhi handle this case.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:53.540
And let Reena assist her.
- See.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:55.710
Simple, very simple.

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:58.780
As a chief doctor,
I don't have to tell you all this.

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:01.510
But you understand what I mean.
- Yeah.. Got it. Done.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.770
Thanks, Arjun.
See you around.

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:05.030
Okay, sir.

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:10.920
Hey, Aruna.
- Sir.

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:13.900
Do you think I'm making Reena
work with Dr. Radhi on purpose?

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:16.590
I don't think so, sir.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:18.890
But I know one thing.

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:22.490
Reena likes to work with Dr. Radhi

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:26.960
Okay.

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:34.900
Idiot.

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:36.720
It must be some idiot's work.

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:40.090
Reena, I remembered it
when you said idiot.

00:22:40.320 --> 00:22:43.400
There is an idiot in my village.
His actual name is idiot.

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:45.210
But he is very intelligent.

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:49.920
By the way,
which idiot are you talking about?

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:51.720
Some idiot spoke to Arjun
and gave him an idea

00:22:51.790 --> 00:22:55.330
that if I work with Dr. Radhi,
I will get impressed with Arjun.

00:22:55.420 --> 00:22:58.250
Otherwise, Arjun wouldn't even
think about it. - Don't shout.

00:22:58.330 --> 00:22:59.170
Why are you shouting?

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:01.870
You might have
misunderstood that idiot.

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:06.150
I am so angry that if I get
hold of him, I will beat him up.

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:09.920
And I will break
his skull into pieces, Rocky.

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:11.450
It's wrong, Reena.
It's wrong.

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:13.170
You shouldn't get so angry.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:19.420
Stories of Thenaliraman may sound
funny, but they have a moral.

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:20.840
If that happens,
what will you do?

00:23:21.140 --> 00:23:22.500
Why are you supporting him?

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:24.550
I am not supporting him.

00:23:24.790 --> 00:23:25.690
I didn't do it.

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:27.040
He is the idiot.

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:29.790
It's all my ill fate, idiot.

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:34.590
Hello.
- Bye, Reena.

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:36.230
If I get hold of him..

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:38.710
You shouldn't get hold of him.

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:42.810
It will be there.
Look carefully.

00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:45.210
No, Mom.
It's is not here.

00:23:46.210 --> 00:23:47.860
Then get him another t-shirt.

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:50.970
He is adamant
for that cartoon T-shirt.

00:23:51.290 --> 00:23:53.040
Then look in your cupboard too.

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:56.050
His shirts and T-shirts
are on the second rack.

00:23:57.380 --> 00:23:59.560
No, Mom, I've looked everywhere.
It's not here.

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:01.870
Look on the left side, Divi.

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:04.610
Mom, he has been crying
for a long time.

00:24:15.380 --> 00:24:16.340
I found it, Mom.

00:24:17.420 --> 00:24:18.960
I told you it will be there.

00:24:19.580 --> 00:24:22.070
It was not in the rack you told me.
It was in the laundry bag.

00:24:23.790 --> 00:24:24.650
Oh.

00:24:25.530 --> 00:24:27.970
Sorry, Divi.
He wore it recently.

00:24:28.080 --> 00:24:29.010
I forgot.

00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:33.850
Mom, he wore this for a short time.
Why did you put it in the laundry?

00:24:36.000 --> 00:24:37.450
Nothing is right here.

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:39.840
Make everything right
the next time, Mom.

00:24:40.050 --> 00:24:41.710
Divi..
- He is torturing me.

00:24:43.280 --> 00:24:44.290
Divi, I am not..

00:24:48.080 --> 00:24:48.930
Ma'am.

00:24:50.540 --> 00:24:52.090
What do you want?
- A new case, ma'am.

00:24:52.170 --> 00:24:54.610
Her name is Meena.
She has been emotionally unstable.

00:24:54.670 --> 00:24:57.500
A few days ago,
she had a fight and went to sleep.

00:24:57.590 --> 00:25:00.630
Her motor function is limited.
She can't even talk.

00:25:00.670 --> 00:25:01.960
Why are you telling me all this?

00:25:02.960 --> 00:25:05.450
Dr. Preetham
has asked me to work with you.

00:26:16.257 --> 00:26:19.167
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:26:21.287 --> 00:26:23.917
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:26:26.377 --> 00:26:29.497
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:26:31.187 --> 00:26:33.457
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:26:33.787 --> 00:26:36.097
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:26:36.427 --> 00:26:38.947
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:26:39.137 --> 00:26:41.697
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:26:43.867 --> 00:26:46.617
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:26:48.867 --> 00:26:51.617
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:26:53.507 --> 00:26:57.687
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:27:19.567 --> 00:27:21.437
Oh, hi.

00:27:23.207 --> 00:27:25.517
What happened, Arjun?
Are you not coming to the hospital?

00:27:26.287 --> 00:27:28.357
I am planning to come
to the hospital like this.

00:27:29.387 --> 00:27:30.397
Why?

00:27:30.807 --> 00:27:32.817
I always come in formal attire.

00:27:33.387 --> 00:27:34.607
I look very serious.

00:27:34.947 --> 00:27:35.977
But I am not.

00:27:36.517 --> 00:27:37.397
Oh.

00:27:40.357 --> 00:27:41.707
Why are you looking
at me like that?

00:27:43.237 --> 00:27:45.227
This costume change is okay.

00:27:45.307 --> 00:27:47.067
But will they accept it
in the hospital?

00:27:48.017 --> 00:27:50.067
Who are they to accept us?
- Us?

00:27:50.427 --> 00:27:52.687
I-I mean me.

00:27:53.567 --> 00:27:55.227
I like this costume.

00:27:55.457 --> 00:27:56.317
I will wear it.

00:28:00.317 --> 00:28:01.437
Why this sudden change?

00:28:02.677 --> 00:28:04.557
Everything is for a reason.

00:28:05.397 --> 00:28:07.017
Reason?

00:28:08.397 --> 00:28:10.767
I got it.
I found the reason.

00:28:10.887 --> 00:28:13.517
This costume is for Manasa, right?

00:28:14.337 --> 00:28:15.567
Manasa?
- Yes.

00:28:15.747 --> 00:28:18.817
You saw her at a cafe
and gave her a ride.

00:28:18.857 --> 00:28:21.147
Since she didn't get a job,
you gave her one.

00:28:21.307 --> 00:28:25.187
Now you're growing your beard,
changing your style..

00:28:25.327 --> 00:28:26.227
Okay.

00:28:26.487 --> 00:28:29.317
Anyway, good luck.
I will leave, bye.

00:28:29.757 --> 00:28:31.147
Reena.

00:28:31.457 --> 00:28:33.387
Hear me out..
- Be well!

00:28:36.317 --> 00:28:38.017
Did it work?

00:28:38.107 --> 00:28:38.977
She is smiling.

00:28:39.167 --> 00:28:42.687
Idiot! She thinks
that I did this for Manasa.

00:28:43.297 --> 00:28:44.187
Manasa?

00:28:44.927 --> 00:28:47.687
Why didn't I think about it?
- What's the point now?

00:28:48.047 --> 00:28:49.017
Hi, Arjun.

00:28:51.907 --> 00:28:52.817
Hi.

00:28:56.647 --> 00:28:58.067
Your attire looks cool.

00:28:58.877 --> 00:29:01.977
It looks very stylish and good.

00:29:02.047 --> 00:29:03.547
Thank you.
- It suits you.

00:29:04.327 --> 00:29:05.187
Thank you.
- Bye.

00:29:09.227 --> 00:29:10.567
Reena is right.

00:29:12.147 --> 00:29:13.107
Smile more.

00:29:17.267 --> 00:29:19.937
How are you related to Meena?
- I'm Meena's husband.

00:29:22.107 --> 00:29:25.317
Okay. They said that you took her
to many hospitals.

00:29:25.357 --> 00:29:27.317
But why didn't you get
a proper diagnosis?

00:29:27.427 --> 00:29:28.937
No, Doctor.

00:29:29.347 --> 00:29:31.267
She gets tense
when she has to go to a hospital.

00:29:31.627 --> 00:29:33.647
She breaks things.

00:29:33.887 --> 00:29:36.617
Despite that, I convinced her
and took her to a doctor.

00:29:38.647 --> 00:29:43.477
Some doctors said that she
behaved like that due to stress.

00:29:43.937 --> 00:29:47.437
Is she always like this?
How is her nature?

00:29:48.467 --> 00:29:50.857
Meena is a common, soft type.

00:29:51.347 --> 00:29:53.397
She doesn't get angry easily.

00:29:54.797 --> 00:29:57.947
She needs patience
to teach music to 30 people.

00:29:58.087 --> 00:29:59.817
She has a lot of patience.

00:30:00.027 --> 00:30:00.857
Oh.

00:30:01.107 --> 00:30:01.977
Okay.

00:30:03.247 --> 00:30:05.977
Doctor, were you able
to diagnose the issue?

00:30:07.037 --> 00:30:08.147
Unfortunately, no.

00:30:08.507 --> 00:30:12.227
We can't physically
suspect this case.

00:30:12.287 --> 00:30:15.977
We need proper proof and facts
to confirm this.

00:30:16.387 --> 00:30:20.477
Before that, we can't say
which department this falls under.

00:30:24.437 --> 00:30:27.857
But don't worry.
Let's hope for the best.

00:30:36.777 --> 00:30:40.567
We don't know what your sister
is doing in the hospital.

00:30:41.277 --> 00:30:42.837
We don't know
what she is going to do.

00:30:43.387 --> 00:30:46.187
But how can you eat
so calmly like this?

00:30:50.617 --> 00:30:51.567
Don't die on me.

00:30:53.407 --> 00:30:55.607
Your sister is giving counselling.

00:30:55.977 --> 00:30:59.137
On the other hand, Manasa and
Arjun spend a lot of time together.

00:31:00.107 --> 00:31:01.767
None of this feels right.

00:31:02.437 --> 00:31:03.727
I'll take care of it.

00:31:04.567 --> 00:31:05.897
Shall I give you an idea?

00:31:09.647 --> 00:31:10.687
You do this.

00:31:10.827 --> 00:31:13.437
Go straight to Arjun
and tell him everything.

00:31:16.347 --> 00:31:18.897
Tell him who you are,
who Manasa is

00:31:19.397 --> 00:31:21.927
and why she has come
to this hospital.

00:31:22.147 --> 00:31:23.577
Tell him everything.

00:31:24.437 --> 00:31:25.357
Nice.

00:31:26.017 --> 00:31:30.437
Actually, you want me
to ruin my own life, right?

00:31:33.537 --> 00:31:36.727
If I tell the truth,
they'll fire me from this hospital.

00:31:37.187 --> 00:31:38.857
It'll be difficult to get a job.

00:31:40.767 --> 00:31:42.647
I should suffer
for what Manasa and Madan did.

00:31:43.317 --> 00:31:46.517
Hey, don't bring
your siblings drama to me.

00:31:47.737 --> 00:31:50.567
The patients and this hospital
are very important to me.

00:31:52.617 --> 00:31:54.817
I'm not saying anything to anyone.

00:31:55.657 --> 00:31:56.727
Naveen.

00:31:57.257 --> 00:32:00.897
You better stop Manasa.

00:32:02.097 --> 00:32:04.587
If you don't, I'll tell Arjun.

00:32:06.647 --> 00:32:07.687
Do you understand?

00:32:15.777 --> 00:32:17.677
Hey, Anitha.
How are you?

00:32:18.237 --> 00:32:20.417
Hi.
- Is Guna fine? All okay?

00:32:21.087 --> 00:32:22.627
Yes, he's fine.

00:32:26.957 --> 00:32:29.537
Hey, you used to dress so formally.

00:32:29.787 --> 00:32:30.977
This is new.

00:32:32.187 --> 00:32:33.397
It'll be like this from now on.

00:32:34.557 --> 00:32:36.437
By the way, why did you call me?

00:32:39.117 --> 00:32:41.437
I heard that you allotted
Reena to Dr. Radhi's team.

00:32:42.587 --> 00:32:43.477
Yes.

00:32:44.027 --> 00:32:45.227
Dr. Preetham suggested it.

00:32:46.227 --> 00:32:47.647
We both decided together.

00:32:47.847 --> 00:32:48.687
Why?

00:32:48.807 --> 00:32:52.077
I'm a senior here.
You didn't even consult me.

00:32:52.997 --> 00:32:55.397
Do you think
I can't handle Meena's case?

00:32:55.617 --> 00:32:58.107
No, Anitha. Reena is
already handling this case.

00:32:58.797 --> 00:33:01.687
And that too, Dr. Preetham
said he has a lot of workload.

00:33:02.107 --> 00:33:03.017
That's why.

00:33:06.517 --> 00:33:07.607
This is nothing new, Arjun.

00:33:07.697 --> 00:33:09.567
You're not letting me
handle my own case

00:33:09.657 --> 00:33:12.267
nor do you allot
any new case to me.

00:33:13.077 --> 00:33:16.437
You're not even considering me as
a senior doctor in this hospital.

00:33:17.417 --> 00:33:20.017
Anitha, calm down.

00:33:20.237 --> 00:33:21.397
I don't understand, Arjun.

00:33:21.517 --> 00:33:24.227
Everyone knows about the problem
between Reena and Dr. Radhi.

00:33:24.547 --> 00:33:26.397
Then why should they work
on the same case?

00:33:26.687 --> 00:33:28.647
You could've simply
allotted me to it.

00:33:29.357 --> 00:33:32.357
It's not a complicated case for two
senior doctors to handle it, Anitha.

00:33:32.907 --> 00:33:33.977
At least, not yet.

00:33:34.567 --> 00:33:35.817
Why don't you understand that?

00:33:37.037 --> 00:33:38.067
And moreover..

00:33:38.817 --> 00:33:41.187
Your role in this hospital
is very important.

00:33:42.187 --> 00:33:43.357
You're a mentor.

00:33:44.027 --> 00:33:47.007
You're guiding the new interns
and residents.

00:33:47.277 --> 00:33:49.397
I can't guide
junior doctors, Arjun.

00:33:51.887 --> 00:33:54.477
I feel like I'm fighting for cases
along with them.

00:33:55.457 --> 00:33:56.517
What is this, Anitha?

00:33:58.727 --> 00:33:59.857
I understand, Arjun.

00:34:00.067 --> 00:34:02.487
You're looking for a solution
to your mistake.

00:34:02.747 --> 00:34:05.647
That's why you've allotted Reena
to Dr. Radhi's team.

00:34:07.277 --> 00:34:11.827
But because of your personal
issues, don't allot my cases to her.

00:34:12.227 --> 00:34:13.767
You don't make any sense, Anitha.

00:34:14.867 --> 00:34:16.857
Oh, so you're denying it.

00:34:17.617 --> 00:34:20.777
You're biasing your position
in this hospital, Arjun.

00:34:21.057 --> 00:34:21.977
That's not right.

00:34:22.077 --> 00:34:24.277
Yes, I'm doing it for her.

00:34:24.677 --> 00:34:25.897
It's a biased decision.

00:34:26.457 --> 00:34:27.517
What's the big deal?

00:34:30.257 --> 00:34:31.127
Oh.

00:34:32.107 --> 00:34:33.107
Okay, then.

00:34:34.337 --> 00:34:37.917
I know how to handle my cases.

00:34:38.457 --> 00:34:39.307
Okay?

00:34:47.717 --> 00:34:49.477
We guessed it right.

00:34:49.937 --> 00:34:50.997
This is Meena's case.

00:34:51.067 --> 00:34:52.437
This is a strange case.

00:34:52.717 --> 00:34:56.017
As per the reports,
she has hyponatremia.

00:34:56.197 --> 00:34:58.397
And her sodium levels are very low.

00:34:58.587 --> 00:35:01.517
122. And her sugar level
is also very low.

00:35:02.527 --> 00:35:05.107
Ma'am, I think if we start
with sodium correction

00:35:05.187 --> 00:35:09.227
we can proceed further based
on how her body reacts to it.

00:35:10.477 --> 00:35:13.557
But Reena,
won't it be risky for the patient?

00:35:14.237 --> 00:35:16.057
Her sodium levels are already low.

00:35:16.417 --> 00:35:17.607
What if you overshoot?

00:35:18.417 --> 00:35:20.477
So, what do you suggest, Teju?

00:35:21.157 --> 00:35:23.357
Ma'am, why don't
we restrict her fluid intake?

00:35:23.777 --> 00:35:25.727
Let's see
how her body reacts to it.

00:35:26.227 --> 00:35:27.807
Teju, we don't have much time.

00:35:28.027 --> 00:35:30.337
If we don't start sodium correction
at the right time

00:35:30.517 --> 00:35:33.017
there is a risk of cerebral oedema.

00:35:35.937 --> 00:35:38.517
Okay, guys.
Let's analyse the patient first.

00:35:39.227 --> 00:35:40.107
Let's see.

00:35:40.397 --> 00:35:41.687
Okay, ma'am.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:35:42.677 --> 00:35:43.647
Meena?

00:35:43.947 --> 00:35:47.437
Meena?
Meena, can you hear me?

00:35:56.547 --> 00:35:57.447
Meena?

00:35:59.797 --> 00:36:02.307
Ma'am, we've given her
3% of hypertonic saline.

00:36:02.787 --> 00:36:06.207
We're calculating her body weight
and giving her 10 ml per hour.

00:36:06.417 --> 00:36:07.497
It's going slow.

00:36:07.557 --> 00:36:09.767
Okay. Teju, glucose?
- Ma'am, glucose is ready.

00:36:11.477 --> 00:36:12.397
Okay, very good.

00:36:12.637 --> 00:36:14.307
Keep monitoring her.

00:36:14.517 --> 00:36:17.057
And don't miss any small detail.

00:36:17.497 --> 00:36:18.857
We'll meet again in two hours.

00:36:18.997 --> 00:36:20.477
Let's see
if there's any improvement.

00:36:20.617 --> 00:36:21.457
Okay, ma'am.

00:36:24.857 --> 00:36:25.977
I'll bring you back.

00:36:50.397 --> 00:36:51.557
What's your observation?

00:36:52.147 --> 00:36:55.647
Ma'am, there are no changes in her
body even after sodium correction.

00:36:56.067 --> 00:36:57.767
Yes, ma'am.
Her body didn't react.

00:37:00.257 --> 00:37:02.977
Did you notice
her body movements?

00:37:04.467 --> 00:37:06.267
Even though
her motor function is not good

00:37:06.307 --> 00:37:08.187
everything is going
according to her will.

00:37:09.057 --> 00:37:11.517
It's like
she's trying to say something.

00:37:13.037 --> 00:37:14.107
She needs our help.

00:37:16.007 --> 00:37:17.017
And..

00:37:18.157 --> 00:37:22.307
Her brain is sending signals
to her body as pulses.

00:37:22.927 --> 00:37:27.157
But the signals don't reach the
right body part at the right time.

00:37:27.457 --> 00:37:28.287
Oh.

00:37:28.357 --> 00:37:30.727
Ma'am, I think there's a clot.

00:37:30.927 --> 00:37:32.307
Shall we run a CT scan?

00:37:32.937 --> 00:37:34.607
Yes, good one. Do it.

00:37:35.517 --> 00:37:36.477
How do you know

00:37:37.607 --> 00:37:38.917
that she's trying to say something?

00:37:39.937 --> 00:37:42.517
When I saw her eyes, I felt it.

00:37:45.737 --> 00:37:47.727
After you get the CT results,
meet me immediately.

00:37:47.827 --> 00:37:49.617
Okay, ma'am.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:37:56.337 --> 00:37:59.857
What happened
to the patient, Padmanaban?

00:38:00.727 --> 00:38:01.687
He's fine.

00:38:04.527 --> 00:38:05.897
Where's Rocky?

00:38:06.327 --> 00:38:07.437
I don't know.

00:38:10.857 --> 00:38:14.477
Also, Anitha and I are..
- I said I don't know.

00:38:17.257 --> 00:38:19.267
Why do you look so sad?

00:38:21.077 --> 00:38:22.727
It's nothing.
- I know.

00:38:23.227 --> 00:38:25.017
I think
they've separated you and Reena.

00:38:26.107 --> 00:38:27.227
Don't say that.

00:38:27.507 --> 00:38:29.857
They've allotted me and Reena
to different departments.

00:38:29.957 --> 00:38:31.707
Oh, okay.

00:38:32.807 --> 00:38:36.607
But it looked like she
couldn't wait to go away.

00:38:37.267 --> 00:38:38.607
Don't irritate me, Nilofer.

00:38:39.647 --> 00:38:40.607
What are you doing here?

00:38:40.877 --> 00:38:43.517
I came here for work.
- Then get back to work.

00:38:44.127 --> 00:38:45.377
So many questions..

00:38:48.917 --> 00:38:50.477
By the way..
- What?

00:38:50.637 --> 00:38:52.717
What do you think
about me and Reena?

00:38:52.827 --> 00:38:53.897
What do I think?

00:38:54.427 --> 00:38:56.857
She went on a date with me.

00:38:57.227 --> 00:38:58.977
She liked the stories I told her.

00:38:59.217 --> 00:39:01.927
Those qualities
apply to me as well.

00:39:01.967 --> 00:39:04.897
All three of us went on the date.
I too believe your stories.

00:39:08.647 --> 00:39:12.057
Why do you want to spoil it
whenever I get emotional?

00:39:14.187 --> 00:39:15.017
Listen.

00:39:15.607 --> 00:39:17.927
I don't know if she likes me.
- I know.

00:39:18.097 --> 00:39:19.767
She doesn't like you.

00:39:22.197 --> 00:39:27.087
Why do you over-imagine it
when she's just being friendly?

00:39:27.187 --> 00:39:29.747
You are jealous.
- Why should I be jealous?

00:39:30.157 --> 00:39:34.647
Yes, whenever I talk about Reena,
you say that it won't work out.

00:39:35.587 --> 00:39:36.977
Do you know her so well?

00:39:37.537 --> 00:39:38.357
Look here.

00:39:38.487 --> 00:39:40.267
She is already facing
a lot of problems.

00:39:40.347 --> 00:39:43.187
I am saying this
because I don't want it

00:39:43.237 --> 00:39:44.927
to affect your friendship with her

00:39:44.977 --> 00:39:47.557
when you smile
at her or compliment her.

00:39:47.737 --> 00:39:49.607
Why do you think
that's what will happen?

00:39:51.467 --> 00:39:52.727
I don't know.

00:39:53.517 --> 00:39:56.607
Whenever I talk about Reena,
you're always negative.

00:39:57.087 --> 00:39:59.547
I'm the one who was being positive.

00:40:00.107 --> 00:40:01.407
I didn't feel that way.

00:40:01.497 --> 00:40:02.897
Because you're a fool.

00:40:04.767 --> 00:40:05.727
Am I a fool?

00:40:06.767 --> 00:40:08.647
Yes, I am a fool indeed.

00:40:13.547 --> 00:40:14.517
Excuse me, ma'am.

00:40:16.407 --> 00:40:17.807
Reena's CT reports.

00:40:18.517 --> 00:40:19.357
Okay.

00:40:23.857 --> 00:40:26.937
This doesn't look like a clot.

00:40:27.497 --> 00:40:29.517
It looks like a mild tissue.

00:40:30.187 --> 00:40:31.057
Calcification?

00:40:32.357 --> 00:40:35.437
Possible.
- Ma'am, please check this report.

00:40:39.617 --> 00:40:41.147
Query tumour.

00:40:41.237 --> 00:40:44.397
Order an MRI immediately.
MRI with MRA and MRV.

00:40:44.737 --> 00:40:46.477
Okay.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:40:46.667 --> 00:40:49.127
And take a PET-CT.

00:40:49.357 --> 00:40:51.857
In case of tumour,
we need to check if it has spread.

00:40:52.937 --> 00:40:55.977
Okay? And Reena, take
handwritten notes for this case.

00:40:56.247 --> 00:40:57.517
I need that.
- Okay, ma'am.

00:41:04.897 --> 00:41:06.787
Look at that.
You want counselling?

00:41:07.217 --> 00:41:08.307
That's my excuse.

00:41:08.897 --> 00:41:09.767
Come.

00:41:13.777 --> 00:41:15.807
How are you, Brother?

00:41:16.457 --> 00:41:18.147
Don't call me your brother.

00:41:20.017 --> 00:41:23.627
Okay. Dr. Naveen,
do you have any problems?

00:41:24.767 --> 00:41:26.307
Who's in your family?

00:41:26.917 --> 00:41:28.357
How many siblings do you have?

00:41:28.897 --> 00:41:31.647
Why are you asking
unnecessary questions?

00:41:32.687 --> 00:41:35.477
Don't you know that you have
to tell everything to the doctor?

00:41:36.557 --> 00:41:38.607
Everyone here is suspecting you.

00:41:40.597 --> 00:41:41.757
What do you mean?

00:41:42.147 --> 00:41:43.037
Who?

00:41:43.357 --> 00:41:45.557
I meant Teju.

00:41:46.037 --> 00:41:46.937
Who's Teju?

00:41:48.187 --> 00:41:50.357
Teju is an intern at this hospital.

00:41:51.117 --> 00:41:52.477
She knows everything about you.

00:41:53.167 --> 00:41:54.037
What do you mean?

00:41:55.747 --> 00:41:58.057
I mean,
she knows everything about us.

00:41:59.007 --> 00:42:00.497
She knows that I am your brother.

00:42:00.767 --> 00:42:01.607
How?

00:42:03.367 --> 00:42:06.187
I told her. But she'd have found
out even if I hadn't told her.

00:42:09.257 --> 00:42:10.107
Let it be.

00:42:10.517 --> 00:42:11.607
What's the big deal?

00:42:11.907 --> 00:42:13.107
What's the big deal?

00:42:13.897 --> 00:42:15.507
You shouldn't cause
any problem here.

00:42:15.627 --> 00:42:18.477
She said that she'll tell everything
to Arjun if there's any problem.

00:42:18.627 --> 00:42:21.147
She's just an intern after all.

00:42:21.977 --> 00:42:25.357
Don't insult me
by posing her as a threat.

00:42:25.987 --> 00:42:28.397
Don't underestimate her.

00:42:31.297 --> 00:42:32.147
Okay.

00:42:32.667 --> 00:42:35.017
Let Teju be a good person.

00:42:36.087 --> 00:42:38.147
Let's get rid of her
if she causes trouble.

00:42:39.507 --> 00:42:42.647
They had got rid of her, but
Dr. Radhi has brought her back.

00:42:47.847 --> 00:42:50.567
Then, create a situation
against her.

00:42:50.697 --> 00:42:52.147
We can get rid of her.
- Me?

00:42:53.047 --> 00:42:55.127
I won't do that.

00:42:59.877 --> 00:43:02.267
I'm not the one
who's getting caught in this.

00:43:03.607 --> 00:43:04.437
You are.

00:43:07.147 --> 00:43:08.267
No, Brother.

00:43:09.427 --> 00:43:13.357
If I do something,
she'll go and tell Arjun.

00:43:14.657 --> 00:43:16.437
If you don't get rid of Teju

00:43:17.727 --> 00:43:19.147
I'll go and tell him.

00:43:20.227 --> 00:43:23.607
Either way,
everyone will come to you.

00:43:27.147 --> 00:43:29.977
I thought if you help me,
I can help you.

00:43:31.607 --> 00:43:37.477
But there are many things
for me to concentrate on.

00:43:39.137 --> 00:43:41.757
So, you take care of yourself.

00:43:48.487 --> 00:43:49.517
You didn't leave yet?

00:44:00.107 --> 00:44:02.227
Sir, Meena's reports are here.

00:44:04.817 --> 00:44:05.687
What happened?

00:44:07.317 --> 00:44:08.807
She has a brain tumour.

00:44:09.477 --> 00:44:12.727
The tumour has affected her
speech and motor function areas.

00:44:18.857 --> 00:44:21.307
You can understand
what's happening around you.

00:44:22.107 --> 00:44:25.267
You are trying to say something,
but no one can understand it.

00:44:27.897 --> 00:44:30.017
Do you feel trapped in your body?

00:44:32.777 --> 00:44:33.897
One minute.

00:44:35.017 --> 00:44:36.057
Get me some papers.

00:44:36.527 --> 00:44:37.557
Papers.
- Wait, ma'am.

00:44:50.397 --> 00:44:52.147
Yes.
No.

00:44:56.647 --> 00:44:58.727
You can understand what's
happening around you, right?

00:45:16.517 --> 00:45:18.857
Doctor, what do we do now?

00:45:19.077 --> 00:45:21.057
Sir, we have to remove the tumour.

00:45:21.157 --> 00:45:23.187
We have to do an awake craniotomy.

00:45:23.507 --> 00:45:26.107
We have to open her skull
and remove the tumour.

00:45:27.267 --> 00:45:29.307
It's enough
if she gets back to normal.

00:45:29.387 --> 00:45:30.357
Do whatever you can.

00:45:31.517 --> 00:45:35.147
Luckily, the tumour didn't affect
any other part of her body.

00:45:35.437 --> 00:45:38.017
So, if we remove the tumour,
she will be alright.

00:45:38.897 --> 00:45:39.807
Thank God.

00:45:40.807 --> 00:45:41.857
Are you okay with it?

00:45:45.627 --> 00:45:48.227
Reena, book a neurosurgeon
and an onco surgeon.

00:45:48.427 --> 00:45:50.437
Book an OT and get the consent.

00:45:50.647 --> 00:45:51.527
Sure, ma'am.

00:45:52.117 --> 00:45:52.957
Here.

00:46:02.787 --> 00:46:03.667
Come.

00:46:04.027 --> 00:46:05.397
Did you have a lot of work today?

00:46:06.077 --> 00:46:07.107
Yes, Aunt.

00:46:08.267 --> 00:46:10.357
Do you have any new updates?

00:46:11.367 --> 00:46:14.227
You ask me the same question
every day. Don't you get bored?

00:46:14.817 --> 00:46:16.267
That's how it is.
You tell me.

00:46:18.057 --> 00:46:20.627
I was asked to work with Dr. Radhi.

00:46:21.647 --> 00:46:22.687
She doesn't like it.

00:46:23.307 --> 00:46:24.857
But this is
the chief doctor's order.

00:46:25.287 --> 00:46:29.307
You will spend a lot of time
together and talk a lot.

00:46:29.417 --> 00:46:30.437
Aunt, please.

00:46:31.107 --> 00:46:33.187
Did Radhi come home?

00:46:33.867 --> 00:46:36.357
No, she has two more hours of work.

00:46:36.607 --> 00:46:37.727
Will it take that long?

00:46:38.497 --> 00:46:39.727
Why are you so sad?

00:46:39.997 --> 00:46:42.837
Sid and Devi are alone at home.

00:46:42.997 --> 00:46:43.807
That's why I asked.

00:46:43.927 --> 00:46:44.897
Isn't Mr. Dev there?

00:46:45.397 --> 00:46:46.857
I don't think he is in town.

00:46:47.627 --> 00:46:48.657
Oh.

00:46:49.347 --> 00:46:51.767
Reena, I don't know
if the kids had food.

00:46:51.927 --> 00:46:53.857
Go and check.
- No need.

00:46:54.097 --> 00:46:55.727
They will blame me.

00:46:56.407 --> 00:46:57.517
Go.

00:46:57.667 --> 00:46:59.557
They would've ordered food online.

00:47:00.247 --> 00:47:01.687
They are kids, Reena.

00:47:02.257 --> 00:47:03.147
I won't go.

00:47:08.507 --> 00:47:10.057
Hi, dude.
- Hi, dude.

00:47:10.807 --> 00:47:11.767
What are you doing?

00:47:11.867 --> 00:47:13.267
See for yourself, dude.

00:47:18.907 --> 00:47:20.727
What is this smell?

00:47:21.767 --> 00:47:23.397
What are you doing?

00:47:23.937 --> 00:47:26.177
Switch off the stove.
- Why did you come here?

00:47:26.257 --> 00:47:27.397
What are you doing?

00:47:27.957 --> 00:47:30.957
Sid said that he was hungry.
So, I thought of cooking for him.

00:47:31.037 --> 00:47:32.357
Is this how you cook?

00:47:32.577 --> 00:47:34.617
I can cook the way I know how.

00:47:35.507 --> 00:47:36.807
You could have ordered online.

00:47:36.897 --> 00:47:39.897
I don't have cash. I don't
even know the payment details.

00:47:40.437 --> 00:47:42.057
You could have asked mom.

00:47:42.257 --> 00:47:44.757
Mom didn't pick up the call.
- You could have asked your dad.

00:47:44.977 --> 00:47:46.267
Dad is not here.

00:47:46.647 --> 00:47:47.977
I am hungry.

00:47:48.937 --> 00:47:49.897
Go and sit.

00:47:50.257 --> 00:47:52.477
I won't eat it if you cook.
- Don't eat.

00:47:52.587 --> 00:47:54.857
I am cooking for Sid and me.
Go and sit.

00:47:56.517 --> 00:47:58.187
She has burnt everything.
Go away.

00:48:08.107 --> 00:48:09.807
Sid, what is your favourite colour?

00:48:10.107 --> 00:48:12.807
I really like the colour black.

00:48:13.237 --> 00:48:14.977
Even I like black.

00:48:52.057 --> 00:48:53.357
Anyone can eat.

00:48:54.517 --> 00:48:55.607
I want to eat.

00:49:04.857 --> 00:49:05.747
Have it.

00:49:15.847 --> 00:49:17.687
It is hot and tasty.

00:49:23.897 --> 00:49:25.477
I don't mind if you don't eat.

00:49:31.167 --> 00:49:32.717
Okay.
I will eat.

00:49:32.927 --> 00:49:35.017
But I will be angry with you.
Okay?

00:49:37.267 --> 00:49:38.227
Have it.

00:49:40.607 --> 00:49:41.477
Take the spoon.

00:49:52.517 --> 00:49:55.687
Sid, do you know
our grandpa's other phone number?

00:49:56.017 --> 00:49:57.607
I know only one.

00:49:58.057 --> 00:49:59.727
Ask Divi.

00:50:09.807 --> 00:50:10.807
I've had enough.

00:50:22.697 --> 00:50:25.937
Divi, look at me.
Divi, what happened?

00:50:26.077 --> 00:50:28.807
Divi, get up.
- Divi, look at me.

00:50:29.207 --> 00:50:31.687
Divi, get up.
- Divi, what happened?

00:50:31.807 --> 00:50:33.147
Divi..
- What happened?

00:50:33.337 --> 00:50:37.187
'Divi, what happened? Look at me.
- Get up.'

00:50:37.267 --> 00:50:39.557
'Divi.. Get up, Divi.'

00:51:35.544 --> 00:51:38.854
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:51:40.524 --> 00:51:43.024
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:51:45.604 --> 00:51:48.564
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:51:50.314 --> 00:51:52.664
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:51:52.834 --> 00:51:55.254
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:51:55.334 --> 00:51:57.814
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:51:58.084 --> 00:52:00.634
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:52:03.024 --> 00:52:05.764
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:52:08.054 --> 00:52:10.604
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:52:12.784 --> 00:52:17.084
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:52:28.414 --> 00:52:30.904
Divi..
- What happened, Divi?

00:52:30.994 --> 00:52:33.024
Divi..
- Look here.. Hey!

00:52:33.154 --> 00:52:34.994
Is there a first aid kit?
- I don't know!

00:52:36.284 --> 00:52:39.334
Divi.. get up, Divi.

00:52:39.864 --> 00:52:40.754
Divi..

00:52:42.944 --> 00:52:43.844
Close your eyes.

00:52:44.924 --> 00:52:47.954
Divi.. get up.
- Divi, hey..

00:52:48.004 --> 00:52:49.794
Divi, look at me.
- Divi, get up.

00:52:49.854 --> 00:52:53.294
Oh, no, you killed my sister!
- Hey, don't say that.

00:52:53.634 --> 00:52:55.794
Divi, look at me, come on.
- What are you going to do?

00:52:56.024 --> 00:52:57.524
Wait, I'm checking.

00:52:57.814 --> 00:52:59.594
Divi, get up.
- Shall I call mom?

00:53:00.004 --> 00:53:01.594
Don't tell mom.

00:53:01.694 --> 00:53:04.964
She will go mad. She slapped me for
taking Divi to the swimming pool.

00:53:05.054 --> 00:53:07.464
Please be quiet. Divi, get up.
- She is dead.

00:53:07.994 --> 00:53:11.294
She is just unconscious.
You can't say that she is dead.

00:53:18.004 --> 00:53:19.664
Is this how you save me?

00:53:19.924 --> 00:53:21.784
Hey, you are okay, right?

00:53:22.004 --> 00:53:22.894
Are you okay?

00:53:23.074 --> 00:53:24.424
I did not faint.

00:53:24.964 --> 00:53:26.984
You rascal!
I was so scared.

00:53:27.274 --> 00:53:29.924
You hit me with a coconut shell,
right? This is my revenge.

00:53:30.264 --> 00:53:31.304
You also hit me, right?

00:53:32.144 --> 00:53:34.304
You are disturbing my life.

00:53:34.384 --> 00:53:36.554
What life?
Is it good now?

00:53:42.424 --> 00:53:43.714
Wait a minute, I'll be back.

00:53:58.204 --> 00:53:59.054
What is this?

00:53:59.254 --> 00:54:00.984
We got a mail this morning.

00:54:01.494 --> 00:54:02.644
Divorce papers.

00:54:10.754 --> 00:54:12.384
Why are you giving it to me, Divi?

00:54:12.644 --> 00:54:16.524
I have done everything
to unite my parents.

00:54:17.374 --> 00:54:18.304
Okay, so?

00:54:20.064 --> 00:54:21.924
I don't know what to do now.

00:54:22.484 --> 00:54:24.494
I don't know whom to tell this to.

00:54:55.464 --> 00:54:57.554
Hello. Tell me, Reena.

00:55:00.524 --> 00:55:01.344
Hello.

00:55:02.734 --> 00:55:04.104
S-Soni..

00:55:06.694 --> 00:55:08.554
Reena, why are you crying?

00:55:08.654 --> 00:55:10.904
I don't know what to do.

00:55:12.574 --> 00:55:13.574
What happened?

00:55:16.314 --> 00:55:19.534
I feel that I should be selfish.

00:55:21.874 --> 00:55:29.824
I don't know if I am the reason
for everything happening around me.

00:55:31.214 --> 00:55:35.564
I am asking myself
this question every day.

00:55:35.724 --> 00:55:37.344
Did anyone say anything to you?

00:55:37.894 --> 00:55:39.194
Did Radhi say anything to you?

00:55:40.814 --> 00:55:42.624
I can't do this.

00:55:44.374 --> 00:55:45.964
Reena, listen to me.

00:55:46.604 --> 00:55:48.664
If it was someone
else in your place

00:55:48.904 --> 00:55:50.314
they would have entered her house

00:55:50.504 --> 00:55:55.214
and fought with Radhi
to be accepted as her daughter.

00:55:55.624 --> 00:55:57.674
But you didn't do
anything like that.

00:55:59.664 --> 00:56:04.504
You have given them the space
and handled it so maturely.

00:56:05.754 --> 00:56:08.284
I thought so too, Sonia.

00:56:09.334 --> 00:56:14.554
But when Divi came to me
and gave me the divorce papers

00:56:15.144 --> 00:56:17.094
I didn't know what to do.

00:56:18.094 --> 00:56:21.514
She said she doesn't know
whom to complain to.

00:56:22.674 --> 00:56:25.154
I can understand her pain, Sonia.

00:56:25.484 --> 00:56:27.984
But I am the reason for everything.

00:56:28.524 --> 00:56:30.534
I don't know what to do.

00:56:32.074 --> 00:56:35.274
Don't think that you are
the reason for everything.

00:56:36.704 --> 00:56:39.604
Sonia, you don't understand.

00:56:43.034 --> 00:56:48.914
I grew up without my parents.

00:56:49.324 --> 00:56:52.994
But Sid and Divi are not like that.

00:56:53.804 --> 00:56:58.524
Mr. Dev and Dr. Radhi
are really good parents.

00:56:58.804 --> 00:57:00.164
If they get separated now

00:57:02.054 --> 00:57:03.774
how would the kids bear it?

00:57:04.354 --> 00:57:05.524
And Sid..

00:57:06.774 --> 00:57:09.934
He doesn't even know
what's happening.

00:57:09.984 --> 00:57:11.194
What would he do?

00:57:11.294 --> 00:57:13.134
How would he adapt to this?

00:57:14.774 --> 00:57:19.234
If it was me, I would
have suffered alone.

00:57:20.164 --> 00:57:22.654
But when I see
what is happening here

00:57:25.684 --> 00:57:28.154
I feel guilty.

00:57:30.254 --> 00:57:33.964
You are not listening to me.
You are repeating the same thing.

00:57:34.254 --> 00:57:35.934
What do you want to do now?

00:57:36.554 --> 00:57:39.964
Sonia, I want to do something.

00:57:43.604 --> 00:57:45.324
Okay, you can do it.

00:57:45.574 --> 00:57:46.904
First, get some sleep.

00:57:47.184 --> 00:57:49.554
We will decide it after you wake
up in the morning. Okay?

00:59:03.804 --> 00:59:04.714
Hey..

00:59:06.144 --> 00:59:08.684
I am so sorry..

00:59:09.104 --> 00:59:11.604
I'm so sorry.
Please clean it.

00:59:14.274 --> 00:59:17.294
I am so sorry. Sit down.
- Please..

00:59:18.944 --> 00:59:21.894
Bro, two large.
For him also.

00:59:22.454 --> 00:59:23.884
No need, sir.
I will get it.

00:59:24.244 --> 00:59:26.064
What are you saying?
You spilt it because of me.

00:59:26.204 --> 00:59:27.054
It's on me.

00:59:27.624 --> 00:59:30.594
This one is for my happiness
and this is for your happiness.

00:59:32.354 --> 00:59:33.254
No, sir.

00:59:33.624 --> 00:59:34.774
I am not happy.

00:59:35.294 --> 00:59:36.444
Oh, no.

00:59:39.244 --> 00:59:41.314
Have it, sir.
Everything will be fine.

00:59:43.344 --> 00:59:44.504
Cheers.
- Cheers.

00:59:51.644 --> 00:59:53.434
I am Dev.
- I am Vijay.

00:59:53.534 --> 00:59:54.454
Nice to meet you.

00:59:55.064 --> 00:59:55.974
What do you do?

00:59:56.224 --> 00:59:59.954
I am a doctor,
medical investigative officer.

01:00:01.184 --> 01:00:03.514
I work in Mumbai. But I have
come to Chennai on some work.

01:00:06.534 --> 01:00:09.074
What is a medical
investigative officer?

01:00:09.494 --> 01:00:11.534
Medical cases don't
get solved easily.

01:00:12.334 --> 01:00:13.904
A patient might have died.

01:00:14.714 --> 01:00:16.544
The hospital might
have given a reason.

01:00:16.994 --> 01:00:18.794
The patient's family might
have given a reason.

01:00:19.384 --> 01:00:22.224
It is my responsibility
to investigate

01:00:22.304 --> 01:00:23.964
and punish those
who are in the wrong.

01:00:24.214 --> 01:00:26.804
That sounds like a police job.
- Yes.

01:00:26.974 --> 01:00:28.854
That is what a medical
investigative officer is.

01:00:30.044 --> 01:00:30.924
Super, sir.

01:00:31.294 --> 01:00:33.594
But I have never heard about this.

01:00:36.504 --> 01:00:38.884
Why are you sad, sir?

01:00:39.984 --> 01:00:42.244
That is..
- Wait..

01:00:45.824 --> 01:00:46.754
Two large, bro.

01:00:57.754 --> 01:00:58.674
What is the problem?

01:01:02.134 --> 01:01:05.254
Life is full of problems.
- What do you mean?

01:01:06.254 --> 01:01:07.134
Sir.

01:01:07.724 --> 01:01:10.044
We shouldn't trust women.

01:01:11.934 --> 01:01:13.464
If you say that we
shouldn't trust women

01:01:13.604 --> 01:01:15.134
at the age of 18,
it is love failure.

01:01:16.194 --> 01:01:17.504
You must be around 40 years old.

01:01:18.564 --> 01:01:21.004
If you say that we shouldn't trust
women now, it is marriage failure.

01:01:22.424 --> 01:01:24.634
Am I right, sir?
- Yes, sir.

01:01:27.174 --> 01:01:28.174
It is love, sir.

01:01:29.494 --> 01:01:31.174
The more we love someone

01:01:31.784 --> 01:01:34.094
the more they make us suffer.
Isn't it, sir?

01:01:34.494 --> 01:01:35.704
Yes, sir.

01:01:36.084 --> 01:01:38.074
No matter how much
they make us suffer

01:01:39.924 --> 01:01:41.704
the love we have for them
would never decrease.

01:01:41.914 --> 01:01:44.054
Isn't it, sir?
- Yes, sir.

01:01:45.134 --> 01:01:47.094
Why are you saying yes
to everything, sir?

01:01:47.334 --> 01:01:48.424
Tell me your love story.

01:01:52.724 --> 01:01:54.264
Why do you want to know that now?

01:01:55.354 --> 01:01:56.614
I have two children.

01:01:58.084 --> 01:02:00.134
What should I say?
- What do you mean?

01:02:00.734 --> 01:02:02.554
Even if you become
an old man with no teeth

01:02:02.634 --> 01:02:03.754
it is still love, sir.

01:02:05.094 --> 01:02:06.054
Okay, leave it.

01:02:06.574 --> 01:02:07.754
I will tell you my love story.

01:02:10.614 --> 01:02:11.744
Bro, too large, please.

01:02:19.124 --> 01:02:22.604
I met her for the first
time in school, sir.

01:02:27.214 --> 01:02:29.724
I also saw her
for the first time in a hospital.

01:02:31.714 --> 01:02:34.254
This is good. We can go
back and forth with our stories.

01:02:34.594 --> 01:02:35.704
Let's continue like this.

01:02:38.384 --> 01:02:41.584
When I saw her for the first time

01:02:42.524 --> 01:02:44.884
a man was beating me, sir.

01:02:46.194 --> 01:02:47.584
In the midst of that pain

01:02:49.594 --> 01:02:51.384
she looked like an angel, sir.

01:02:56.034 --> 01:02:57.624
When I saw her for the first time

01:02:58.704 --> 01:03:00.104
I lost it.

01:03:01.084 --> 01:03:02.944
As Director Gautham Menon
says in a movie

01:03:04.214 --> 01:03:05.454
my heart skipped a beat.

01:03:06.804 --> 01:03:09.464
That's when I understood
its meaning, sir.

01:03:11.384 --> 01:03:13.744
She looked like the light
at the end of a tunnel.

01:03:15.474 --> 01:03:16.624
Like a candle light.

01:03:17.354 --> 01:03:18.474
Warm and beautiful.

01:03:18.854 --> 01:03:20.964
Poetry..
Super, sir..

01:03:21.434 --> 01:03:22.344
My turn.

01:03:25.814 --> 01:03:29.424
My girlfriend lost her mother
when she was young, sir.

01:03:30.744 --> 01:03:33.344
Sir, what a similarity!

01:03:34.114 --> 01:03:35.344
My wife also lost her mother.

01:03:40.124 --> 01:03:41.304
She had a father.

01:03:42.624 --> 01:03:45.284
He was crazy.

01:03:45.704 --> 01:03:48.594
Sir, she too has a father.

01:03:49.014 --> 01:03:50.464
But he is a complete lunatic, sir.

01:03:51.674 --> 01:03:52.864
Drink.

01:03:58.664 --> 01:03:59.674
But I really..

01:04:01.194 --> 01:04:02.474
I really loved her, sir.

01:04:02.834 --> 01:04:05.634
Sir, I swear.

01:04:06.604 --> 01:04:08.464
I also loved her a lot, sir.

01:04:08.944 --> 01:04:10.504
Her boldness.

01:04:11.374 --> 01:04:12.344
Her anger.

01:04:12.694 --> 01:04:13.804
Her arrogance.

01:04:14.934 --> 01:04:15.964
Her beauty.

01:04:16.534 --> 01:04:17.594
No matter what.

01:04:17.874 --> 01:04:19.314
I was there for her.

01:04:19.954 --> 01:04:21.234
I was always there for her.

01:04:22.834 --> 01:04:24.424
But she betrayed me, sir.

01:04:32.634 --> 01:04:34.714
Raise the glass.
Raise the glass.

01:04:35.264 --> 01:04:36.134
Sir.

01:04:37.384 --> 01:04:38.804
I like you a lot.

01:04:39.554 --> 01:04:41.264
So, let's drop the formalities.

01:04:41.604 --> 01:04:43.184
I am Vijay.
You are Dev.

01:04:43.314 --> 01:04:44.454
Yeah.
- Dev.

01:04:45.734 --> 01:04:46.644
Dev.

01:04:48.274 --> 01:04:49.454
I swear to God.

01:04:50.054 --> 01:04:52.474
You will only have good things
happening to you in life.

01:04:54.194 --> 01:04:55.534
Thank you, Vijay.
- Apart from that..

01:04:56.454 --> 01:04:57.884
No matter whatever help you need

01:04:58.324 --> 01:04:59.264
whenever it is..

01:05:01.084 --> 01:05:02.394
Call me. Okay?

01:05:02.584 --> 01:05:03.424
Sure.

01:05:05.834 --> 01:05:06.844
Thank you so much.

01:05:08.134 --> 01:05:12.134
It's been a long time
since I felt so happy.

01:05:13.174 --> 01:05:14.824
Today? It's been a long time?

01:05:16.014 --> 01:05:17.024
Then..

01:05:18.184 --> 01:05:19.604
One large for the road.

01:05:20.394 --> 01:05:21.564
Bro..
- Bro!

01:05:22.764 --> 01:05:23.894
Two large.

01:05:27.894 --> 01:05:28.774
Excuse me, ma'am.

01:05:30.714 --> 01:05:33.074
Ma'am, here are Meena's reports.
- Okay.

01:05:44.954 --> 01:05:45.964
What file is this?

01:05:46.204 --> 01:05:47.544
The dates are different.

01:05:48.154 --> 01:05:50.134
Did we plan
for the surgery with this?

01:05:54.304 --> 01:05:55.114
Ma'am..

01:05:55.844 --> 01:05:57.474
I didn't do this, ma'am.

01:05:58.384 --> 01:06:00.444
This is not the file
I prepared, ma'am.

01:06:00.594 --> 01:06:02.464
Don't you know to check it
before giving it to me?

01:06:02.854 --> 01:06:04.344
Your focus should be
on work, Reena.

01:06:04.934 --> 01:06:07.774
No, ma'am, I was careful.
I don't know how this happened.

01:06:07.974 --> 01:06:10.074
This is not my handwriting, ma'am.
Take a look.

01:06:10.244 --> 01:06:11.894
Then, where is the file
that you prepared?

01:06:12.104 --> 01:06:13.784
How did it change
without your knowledge?

01:06:14.364 --> 01:06:19.384
Ma'am, no, something is wrong.

01:06:19.664 --> 01:06:21.404
This is not my handwriting.
- Ma'am.

01:06:22.864 --> 01:06:23.854
Did you call me?

01:06:29.124 --> 01:06:31.594
Why are you both
looking at me strangely?

01:06:33.504 --> 01:06:35.564
Someone changed
the file that I prepared.

01:06:36.544 --> 01:06:38.554
Hey, I didn't do anything.
Ma'am!

01:06:39.214 --> 01:06:41.114
Why are you
looking at me with doubt?

01:06:41.984 --> 01:06:45.254
Reena, you are blaming
others for your mistakes.

01:06:45.734 --> 01:06:46.634
No, ma'am.

01:06:47.144 --> 01:06:48.544
Teju, you follow the record.

01:06:49.064 --> 01:06:50.564
And prepare for the surgery.

01:06:53.794 --> 01:06:54.674
Okay.

01:07:00.504 --> 01:07:01.344
Sure, ma'am.

01:07:15.684 --> 01:07:16.634
Hey, Kamal.
- Sir.

01:07:17.044 --> 01:07:17.964
What's the update?

01:07:18.594 --> 01:07:20.044
Sir, it's about Gayathri's case.

01:07:20.504 --> 01:07:22.664
She's not letting me
administer an injection.

01:07:22.974 --> 01:07:25.844
If I get a syringe near her,
she cries like a kid.

01:07:26.534 --> 01:07:27.424
Okay.

01:07:27.974 --> 01:07:30.354
How is the new case?
Did you check?

01:07:30.564 --> 01:07:32.734
Did you find anything?
- New case?

01:07:32.834 --> 01:07:35.744
I don't know which one you are
talking about. - That music teacher.

01:07:35.844 --> 01:07:38.464
Meena.
- Oh, that one! I don't know, sir.

01:07:39.784 --> 01:07:43.144
I'm already swamped
with the work that you've given me.

01:07:43.284 --> 01:07:44.994
Then, how can I look at that case?

01:07:46.744 --> 01:07:47.934
But, sir..

01:07:48.084 --> 01:07:51.414
Poor Reena, I think she is
getting scolded by Dr. Radhi.

01:07:52.504 --> 01:07:55.074
How do you say that?
- Yes, I was in the interns' room.

01:07:55.354 --> 01:07:56.924
Reena was very angry.

01:07:57.024 --> 01:07:59.034
She was talking about getting
scolded by Dr. Radhi.

01:07:59.094 --> 01:08:00.354
Mr. Arjun also came.

01:08:00.464 --> 01:08:02.664
He took her to the canteen
to pacify her.

01:08:02.994 --> 01:08:04.054
Why did she scold her?

01:08:04.314 --> 01:08:07.054
Sir, the patient record that Reena
prepared was somehow switched.

01:08:07.174 --> 01:08:09.024
The data in the file
was completely wrong.

01:08:09.224 --> 01:08:11.884
That's why Dr. Radhi
has scolded her harshly.

01:08:14.064 --> 01:08:14.984
So..

01:08:16.944 --> 01:08:18.864
Radhi versus Reena.

01:08:19.864 --> 01:08:20.954
You can say that, sir.

01:08:21.214 --> 01:08:22.804
Capital R versus small r.

01:08:24.034 --> 01:08:25.524
The problem has started.

01:08:27.034 --> 01:08:28.234
'You'd feel pleased.'

01:08:28.684 --> 01:08:30.344
Sir.
- Yes, Amaya.

01:08:32.064 --> 01:08:36.924
The updated reports and Ilakya's
test results are here, sir.

01:08:39.494 --> 01:08:43.354
Also, you asked me to remind you
to check on her after an hour, sir.

01:08:43.764 --> 01:08:44.614
Okay.

01:08:55.394 --> 01:08:56.264
Sir.

01:08:57.484 --> 01:08:59.604
I've checked the files.
Shall I go for my rounds, sir?

01:09:07.784 --> 01:09:09.444
Amaya.
- Tell me.

01:09:09.554 --> 01:09:12.344
You didn't even look at me.

01:09:12.874 --> 01:09:14.254
Are you cross with me?

01:09:15.174 --> 01:09:16.044
No.

01:09:16.524 --> 01:09:19.004
I'm not cross with you, Doctor.
- Then what is it?

01:09:21.134 --> 01:09:22.584
What do you know about me?

01:09:23.664 --> 01:09:26.004
You know only what I've told you.

01:09:26.684 --> 01:09:28.884
My family and our situation..

01:09:29.224 --> 01:09:31.514
I have not shared
many things with you.

01:09:32.874 --> 01:09:35.674
What are you saying? We don't have
to know those for liking someone.

01:09:36.604 --> 01:09:37.834
You need to know, Doctor.

01:09:38.484 --> 01:09:40.974
If you raise my hopes
and then squash it later..

01:09:41.664 --> 01:09:43.424
It will be very difficult for me.

01:09:43.774 --> 01:09:46.144
I feel everything that you feel.

01:09:46.784 --> 01:09:48.314
But..
- Amaya.

01:09:48.904 --> 01:09:50.454
That is a good thing, right?

01:09:51.994 --> 01:09:53.804
That's why I'm more scared.

01:09:54.704 --> 01:09:56.184
What are you scared of?

01:09:56.544 --> 01:09:59.034
I just told you that
my situation is bad.

01:09:59.174 --> 01:10:01.504
But I didn't share anything
about it with you.

01:10:02.504 --> 01:10:06.714
If I had told you about it, you
wouldn't have confessed to me.

01:10:07.214 --> 01:10:09.424
I don't even know
if you would have spoken to me.

01:10:10.344 --> 01:10:12.894
What are you saying, Amaya?
- No, Doctor.

01:10:13.304 --> 01:10:15.134
It's not wrong to love someone.

01:10:15.734 --> 01:10:18.304
But who we love is very important.

01:10:20.814 --> 01:10:22.064
A-Amaya..

01:10:26.774 --> 01:10:28.004
Hey, Kiran, bye.

01:10:28.574 --> 01:10:30.334
Bye?
Are you leaving already?

01:10:30.534 --> 01:10:32.884
I'm done with work, so I'm leaving.
Why aren't you leaving?

01:10:33.324 --> 01:10:35.844
Don't ask me. I didn't know
till Reena was here.

01:10:36.164 --> 01:10:38.584
Now, the workload is heavy.
I can't.

01:10:39.754 --> 01:10:40.784
You deserve this.

01:10:41.754 --> 01:10:43.754
Hey, my dad said
that you're coming for dinner.

01:10:44.134 --> 01:10:45.154
Are you really coming?

01:10:45.294 --> 01:10:47.084
Dinner? What dinner?

01:10:48.554 --> 01:10:50.114
Take your phone
and check your messages.

01:10:51.004 --> 01:10:51.924
Message?

01:10:56.304 --> 01:10:59.424
Good morning..
- Hey.

01:11:00.174 --> 01:11:02.924
Don't you even open
my dad's messages? - Hey.

01:11:03.274 --> 01:11:07.124
He sends me a good
morning text every day.

01:11:08.424 --> 01:11:10.704
Good morning..

01:11:11.104 --> 01:11:12.134
Look at this.

01:11:12.924 --> 01:11:15.244
'Hello, Kiran.
Are you free on Thursday?'

01:11:15.784 --> 01:11:17.994
'If you are free,
shall we go for dinner together?'

01:11:18.874 --> 01:11:21.204
'If you come there,
you'll get a surprise.'

01:11:22.124 --> 01:11:23.474
He has asked if I'm coming.

01:11:23.714 --> 01:11:24.554
I'm not coming.

01:11:24.924 --> 01:11:25.744
Why not?

01:11:26.184 --> 01:11:27.054
Hey, idiot.

01:11:27.154 --> 01:11:28.804
What would I do
at your family dinner?

01:11:29.764 --> 01:11:32.094
Hey, he is thinking
that you'll come.

01:11:33.174 --> 01:11:35.274
Hey, I can't go.

01:11:38.104 --> 01:11:41.304
Okay, it's up to you. I'll tell him
that you aren't coming.

01:11:41.424 --> 01:11:42.594
I'm glad.

01:11:42.814 --> 01:11:47.424
My dad will come to the hospital
directly. You handle him.

01:11:47.864 --> 01:11:49.324
Why is he coming to the hospital?

01:11:50.034 --> 01:11:54.134
He is like that. Do you know how
he'd torture you if he likes you?

01:11:54.654 --> 01:11:55.554
I know.

01:11:56.034 --> 01:11:58.714
Give me your hand.
Welcome to the club.

01:12:00.204 --> 01:12:04.264
Hey, Nilofer,
I'll come to the dinner.

01:12:05.074 --> 01:12:06.304
I know.
- You know?

01:12:09.054 --> 01:12:12.614
God, I don't know how I'm going
to escape from this family.

01:12:13.094 --> 01:12:14.594
You have to help me.

01:12:15.304 --> 01:12:16.244
Excuse me.

01:12:16.684 --> 01:12:17.534
Hi.

01:12:20.674 --> 01:12:22.574
I don't have any appointment
at this time.

01:12:23.374 --> 01:12:25.804
I wanted to come here.
- That's fine.

01:12:28.024 --> 01:12:29.904
What's your name?
- Teju.

01:12:31.094 --> 01:12:31.984
Teju.

01:12:33.834 --> 01:12:34.714
Do you know?

01:12:36.284 --> 01:12:37.184
No.

01:12:38.004 --> 01:12:40.754
I have to know about
the people who work here.

01:12:41.764 --> 01:12:42.744
Oh.

01:12:44.504 --> 01:12:48.054
What's your problem, Teju?
- That is..

01:12:49.214 --> 01:12:50.254
I've been having nightmares

01:12:50.354 --> 01:12:53.554
that something bad is going
to happen to this hospital.

01:12:54.844 --> 01:12:55.744
Is that so?

01:12:57.304 --> 01:13:01.434
If we think about something for
a long time, it becomes a dream.

01:13:02.164 --> 01:13:04.924
It can be good or bad.

01:13:05.604 --> 01:13:08.124
So, you don't have
to worry about it.

01:13:09.234 --> 01:13:10.384
I'm not worried.

01:13:11.624 --> 01:13:14.234
But it's bugging me.

01:13:15.414 --> 01:13:19.134
So, did you try anything
to get rid of that feeling?

01:13:19.994 --> 01:13:21.004
No.

01:13:21.644 --> 01:13:22.714
You have to tell me.

01:13:23.374 --> 01:13:25.274
You are a psychologist, right?

01:13:28.874 --> 01:13:31.824
Which college did you go to?

01:13:31.924 --> 01:13:33.794
Bangalore University.
- Oh.

01:13:34.514 --> 01:13:37.264
Where did you do your internship?
- Central Institute.

01:13:37.424 --> 01:13:39.714
Not bad. You are
saying everything correctly.

01:13:40.344 --> 01:13:43.044
I think you have done
a lot of research about me.

01:13:44.314 --> 01:13:47.454
Generally, you have to know
about the people who work with you.

01:13:48.954 --> 01:13:50.094
I saw your profile.

01:13:50.984 --> 01:13:52.644
It says that you don't
have any siblings.

01:13:54.034 --> 01:13:56.464
I don't have any siblings.
- Is that so?

01:13:57.674 --> 01:14:00.554
There was a board member here.
His name is Madan.

01:14:01.034 --> 01:14:03.284
And I have a friend named Naveen.

01:14:03.954 --> 01:14:07.184
You resemble both of them.

01:14:08.544 --> 01:14:10.244
Is this counselling session
for you or for me?

01:14:12.214 --> 01:14:13.834
You will know
when the session ends.

01:14:15.254 --> 01:14:18.094
By the way,
you didn't know who Teju is.

01:14:18.804 --> 01:14:21.234
But I heard that
you underestimated me.

01:14:22.014 --> 01:14:23.184
I heard about it.

01:14:24.394 --> 01:14:26.884
Now you know who Teju is, right?

01:14:27.684 --> 01:14:31.104
Don't underestimate what I can do
because I'm just an intern.

01:14:32.104 --> 01:14:35.254
If she wants something,
she will do anything for it.

01:14:36.034 --> 01:14:39.044
Why is this hospital
so important to you?

01:14:40.594 --> 01:14:43.134
Why is this hospital
important to me?

01:14:43.744 --> 01:14:45.834
Because the patients here
are very important to me.

01:14:46.984 --> 01:14:51.464
If anyone from outside
wants to take over..

01:14:52.424 --> 01:14:55.194
Who told you that I am going
to take over this hospital?

01:14:56.064 --> 01:14:57.254
I didn't mean you.

01:14:58.714 --> 01:15:00.634
I said someone from outside.
- Oh.

01:15:01.224 --> 01:15:02.134
Okay.

01:15:04.434 --> 01:15:08.304
If anyone from outside
wants to take over..

01:15:11.144 --> 01:15:15.934
You should do something to either
the patients or the doctors here.

01:15:16.624 --> 01:15:19.634
Only then can you
create problems here.

01:15:21.524 --> 01:15:25.274
I won't let my patients get
affected for your selfishness.

01:15:28.244 --> 01:15:29.174
Not only that.

01:15:30.544 --> 01:15:33.984
I want to save this hospital
that saved my father.

01:15:34.364 --> 01:15:36.714
So, be careful.

01:16:50.124 --> 01:16:53.124
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:16:55.124 --> 01:16:57.574
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:17:00.204 --> 01:17:03.024
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:17:04.924 --> 01:17:07.254
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:17:07.434 --> 01:17:09.814
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:17:09.934 --> 01:17:12.534
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:17:12.724 --> 01:17:15.174
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:17:17.644 --> 01:17:20.254
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:17:22.734 --> 01:17:25.164
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:17:27.384 --> 01:17:31.724
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:17:49.644 --> 01:17:51.054
Teju.
- Good morning, ma'am.

01:17:52.104 --> 01:17:54.194
You have met Divi, right?
- Yes, ma'am.

01:17:54.434 --> 01:17:55.254
Hi.

01:17:56.484 --> 01:17:57.564
You sit there, Divi.

01:18:01.254 --> 01:18:04.314
Ma'am, we can start
the surgery in a few hours.

01:18:04.564 --> 01:18:07.314
Okay. Have you briefed
the oncologist and neurosurgeon?

01:18:07.394 --> 01:18:09.064
Yes, ma'am.
- Where is Reena?

01:18:09.574 --> 01:18:10.404
I'll call her.

01:18:14.084 --> 01:18:17.064
Divi, you need to relax and
finish your homework, okay?

01:18:17.624 --> 01:18:18.804
Okay, Mom.

01:18:21.044 --> 01:18:22.964
I've messaged her.
- Okay. - Ma'am.

01:18:27.054 --> 01:18:29.374
Guys, while the surgeon
is removing the tumour

01:18:29.434 --> 01:18:30.934
we have to keep Meena awake.

01:18:31.644 --> 01:18:33.794
We might miss her even if she
slightly loses consciousness.

01:18:34.144 --> 01:18:36.364
Yes, ma'am.
Even while doing the brain mapping

01:18:36.474 --> 01:18:38.984
we should be giving some
activities to the patient. - Yeah.

01:18:39.194 --> 01:18:41.034
We can make her conscious easily.

01:18:41.364 --> 01:18:43.674
But the situation
here is different.

01:18:43.904 --> 01:18:45.724
Ma'am, the only way

01:18:45.844 --> 01:18:48.404
is to keep talking to the patient
throughout the surgery.

01:18:48.424 --> 01:18:50.814
Yeah.
Let Meena's husband talk to her.

01:18:51.194 --> 01:18:53.784
No, ma'am.
He is already emotionally down.

01:18:54.334 --> 01:18:55.544
He can't talk to her.

01:18:56.584 --> 01:18:58.814
Moreover, we don't even know
when the surgery will be over.

01:19:00.624 --> 01:19:01.754
Then, who will talk to her?

01:19:02.174 --> 01:19:04.614
Teju can talk to her, ma'am.
- Hey! Ma'am..

01:19:04.714 --> 01:19:06.104
I can't talk to her for so long.

01:19:06.524 --> 01:19:09.944
You talk to her.
- What would I talk about?

01:19:10.584 --> 01:19:12.304
It becomes a problem
every time I talk.

01:19:13.054 --> 01:19:16.354
Guys, be serious.
Stop arguing over it.

01:19:16.474 --> 01:19:18.114
We can't just talk to her casually.

01:19:18.314 --> 01:19:19.844
We have to be able
to connect with her.

01:19:19.984 --> 01:19:21.474
Only then will she
stay on our track.

01:19:22.584 --> 01:19:24.854
Ma'am, why don't you talk to her?

01:19:25.904 --> 01:19:27.234
What should I talk to her about?
- Ma'am.

01:19:27.444 --> 01:19:29.664
You have more
interesting stories than ours.

01:19:29.864 --> 01:19:33.064
You talk to her.
- No. Think of something else.

01:19:33.324 --> 01:19:34.494
Ma'am, Teju is right.

01:19:35.414 --> 01:19:39.094
I didn't say that she is right.
You have already spoken to Meena.

01:19:39.464 --> 01:19:41.494
If you talk to her,
she will concentrate.

01:19:41.774 --> 01:19:42.734
She will gain confidence.

01:19:48.464 --> 01:19:49.764
Okay.
Let's do this.

01:20:19.734 --> 01:20:22.984
There was an empty spot, right?
Then why are you sitting here?

01:20:23.294 --> 01:20:26.044
Why should I not sit here?
I will sit wherever I want.

01:20:26.824 --> 01:20:30.374
You said that it won't work out.
Then what?

01:20:30.644 --> 01:20:33.914
Oh, if I say that it won't work
out, you won't talk to me?

01:20:34.014 --> 01:20:35.774
You won't even smile at me.
Is that so?

01:20:35.804 --> 01:20:36.644
No.

01:20:36.844 --> 01:20:39.604
You are avoiding me because
you don't want to see my face.

01:20:40.684 --> 01:20:43.694
If I sit in front of you again,
you will hate me, right?

01:20:44.234 --> 01:20:45.234
Did I say that?

01:20:45.714 --> 01:20:47.524
Did I say that I hate you?

01:20:48.824 --> 01:20:51.054
I didn't want
to trouble you, Amaya.

01:20:53.004 --> 01:20:53.864
Okay.

01:20:54.504 --> 01:20:57.064
You are avoiding me as soon as you
got to know about my family situation.

01:20:58.614 --> 01:20:59.984
Don't talk like a fool.

01:21:00.874 --> 01:21:02.484
You're always talking
about your family situations.

01:21:03.094 --> 01:21:05.194
It's not like I am living
in a luxury bungalow.

01:21:06.214 --> 01:21:07.934
Just like how I didn't know
about your situation

01:21:08.294 --> 01:21:10.164
you don't know my situation either.

01:21:10.594 --> 01:21:12.144
Then, why did you say
that you like me?

01:21:13.224 --> 01:21:16.374
Liking someone doesn't have anything
to do with family situations.

01:21:19.474 --> 01:21:21.734
If you say no to anything that I do

01:21:22.394 --> 01:21:23.734
what can I do?

01:21:30.154 --> 01:21:33.394
Don't mind me if I
drink this tea inside.

01:21:33.564 --> 01:21:34.484
Sorry.

01:21:41.184 --> 01:21:42.114
Meena.

01:21:42.584 --> 01:21:44.164
Meena, can you hear me?

01:21:47.864 --> 01:21:49.784
You asked me to talk suddenly.

01:21:51.844 --> 01:21:52.774
Meena.

01:21:53.844 --> 01:21:56.734
I saw your profile saying
that you are a music teacher.

01:21:56.934 --> 01:22:01.114
Your husband also said that
you were teaching 30 students.

01:22:01.684 --> 01:22:05.104
Are you so passionate about music?
Even I like music.

01:22:05.774 --> 01:22:08.414
From my childhood till now

01:22:08.804 --> 01:22:11.104
from morning to night

01:22:11.404 --> 01:22:14.744
I listen to a song
composed by Ilaiyaraaja, on loop.

01:22:15.284 --> 01:22:18.204
Even now, on my way
to and from the hospital

01:22:19.274 --> 01:22:22.314
I play a playlist and
listen to it on high volume.

01:22:23.204 --> 01:22:25.844
Ma'am, do you listen to music?

01:22:26.904 --> 01:22:27.854
Sorry, ma'am.

01:22:33.094 --> 01:22:35.774
Ma'am, Meena has
become unconscious. - Meena..

01:22:36.424 --> 01:22:38.984
Meena..

01:22:44.294 --> 01:22:48.084
Once upon a time,
Ilaiyaraaja had come to our village.

01:22:48.694 --> 01:22:50.084
I was a little girl then.

01:22:50.614 --> 01:22:54.034
I pleaded with my parents
to take me to meet him.

01:22:54.484 --> 01:22:57.834
But they didn't take me
since I had my exams going on.

01:22:58.454 --> 01:23:03.804
But I really wanted to see him.

01:23:03.874 --> 01:23:05.664
So like what Actor Vijay does
in one of his movies

01:23:05.774 --> 01:23:07.954
I pretended to study in my room

01:23:08.084 --> 01:23:10.434
and ran away by scaling
the rear wall of the house.

01:23:10.694 --> 01:23:13.094
But when I went there,
Ilaiyaraaja hadn't come.

01:23:14.574 --> 01:23:16.494
Because, it turned out
to be Composer Deva's concert.

01:23:16.634 --> 01:23:19.564
I didn't care that it was
someone else.

01:23:19.604 --> 01:23:21.764
I just listened
to the whole concert.

01:23:22.224 --> 01:23:25.304
When I came back,
my mom beat me black and blue.

01:23:26.724 --> 01:23:30.204
That day, I cried a lot
till the night.

01:23:30.514 --> 01:23:33.274
I cried till my dad
got me parottas for dinner.

01:23:39.034 --> 01:23:40.484
When I think about it now

01:23:40.794 --> 01:23:43.604
life was so easy back then.

01:23:44.354 --> 01:23:47.814
Ma'am. Meena..
- Meena..

01:23:48.204 --> 01:23:50.544
Meena, look at me.
- Meena.

01:23:57.714 --> 01:24:02.704
Nowadays, even if
something big happens

01:24:02.794 --> 01:24:05.274
we don't react much.

01:24:06.724 --> 01:24:10.644
But back then, even if
something small happens

01:24:10.754 --> 01:24:13.694
we would be on cloud nine.

01:24:14.274 --> 01:24:15.964
Without worrying about anything..

01:24:16.154 --> 01:24:19.564
Me, dad, mom, my world.

01:24:19.904 --> 01:24:20.744
That's it.

01:24:21.044 --> 01:24:23.274
When everything
was going so perfectly..

01:24:24.904 --> 01:24:25.964
A small desire.

01:24:26.634 --> 01:24:28.024
It changed my life completely.

01:24:30.134 --> 01:24:34.484
Whether we understand
what we're doing or not

01:24:36.064 --> 01:24:38.274
we end up doing something
because of that desire.

01:24:39.464 --> 01:24:44.124
The thing that felt right
in that moment, in that minute..

01:24:44.174 --> 01:24:46.824
But when it feels wrong
after many years

01:24:48.564 --> 01:24:49.524
how would we feel?

01:24:51.604 --> 01:24:53.604
Had we known what
was going to happen..

01:24:55.084 --> 01:24:57.234
If we had taken
a different decision that day..

01:24:58.774 --> 01:25:00.984
Our life would have
been different now.

01:25:01.784 --> 01:25:03.494
We would have been
a different person.

01:25:06.064 --> 01:25:06.914
Meena.

01:25:08.624 --> 01:25:09.664
Dr. Radhi.

01:25:09.994 --> 01:25:12.484
We've almost removed the tumour.
Keep her awake.

01:25:14.374 --> 01:25:18.454
Meena, have you ever
thought about it?

01:25:18.804 --> 01:25:20.584
That there'd be
a clot in your brain

01:25:20.714 --> 01:25:23.254
or that you'd be in a situation

01:25:23.294 --> 01:25:25.484
where you feel trapped
in your own body?

01:25:26.484 --> 01:25:29.294
Just like you,
everyone has a problem here.

01:25:29.474 --> 01:25:33.884
Else they are facing the
consequences to their problems.

01:25:34.564 --> 01:25:37.324
Like you, everyone is
trapped in their own body.

01:25:38.404 --> 01:25:39.864
Sometimes, even I am like that.

01:25:42.034 --> 01:25:43.914
I can't tell anyone.

01:25:44.444 --> 01:25:46.004
I can't react.

01:25:47.744 --> 01:25:50.814
But you are lucky.
You got your way out.

01:25:51.454 --> 01:25:52.484
Dr. Radhi.

01:25:54.044 --> 01:25:55.254
The surgery is over.

01:25:55.834 --> 01:25:56.914
You can continue.

01:26:08.434 --> 01:26:10.054
Everything you said is right.

01:26:12.764 --> 01:26:16.114
No one does it
knowing that it is wrong.

01:26:17.854 --> 01:26:19.324
If we know the consequences

01:26:20.564 --> 01:26:21.944
no one would do it.

01:26:22.694 --> 01:26:25.904
But this is what
makes life interesting.

01:26:26.884 --> 01:26:29.894
Sometimes the answer
is right in front of us.

01:26:30.624 --> 01:26:32.284
But we miss it.

01:26:33.834 --> 01:26:35.054
But I know one thing.

01:26:37.544 --> 01:26:39.294
I was trapped inside my body.

01:26:40.884 --> 01:26:44.304
And you came to get me out.

01:26:45.424 --> 01:26:46.484
Similarly..

01:26:47.974 --> 01:26:52.394
Someone will come to get you out.

01:26:58.684 --> 01:26:59.774
Welcome back, Meena.

01:27:08.904 --> 01:27:11.154
I don't think
that story was for Meena.

01:27:11.594 --> 01:27:12.704
It was for Reena.

01:27:13.524 --> 01:27:16.784
Whatever she says now,
it will feel like it's for me.

01:27:18.324 --> 01:27:19.234
Okay.

01:27:19.834 --> 01:27:20.964
What happened to Divi?

01:27:21.424 --> 01:27:22.434
Why is she like that?

01:27:22.884 --> 01:27:24.584
She is facing some
problems at home.

01:27:24.674 --> 01:27:25.694
So, she is like that.

01:27:26.994 --> 01:27:28.354
Is it?
- Yes.

01:27:29.224 --> 01:27:30.814
I feel like
there is some other problem.

01:27:32.264 --> 01:27:33.184
Okay, I'll leave.

01:27:49.534 --> 01:27:52.074
Why do you look so sad?
- Nothing.

01:27:53.664 --> 01:27:55.104
Did Sid fight with you?

01:27:56.664 --> 01:27:58.404
Did mom scold you?
- No.

01:27:58.954 --> 01:28:01.854
Did your dad say anything?
- I said nothing.

01:28:02.154 --> 01:28:03.104
Leave me.

01:28:03.254 --> 01:28:04.774
Hey, what happened?

01:28:05.044 --> 01:28:05.904
Divi, what happened?

01:28:06.334 --> 01:28:07.274
What happened?

01:28:07.994 --> 01:28:08.914
What is this?

01:28:09.114 --> 01:28:09.944
Who hit you?

01:28:11.934 --> 01:28:14.324
A teacher hit me.

01:28:14.434 --> 01:28:16.374
Everyone is scared of him.

01:28:17.144 --> 01:28:19.524
A boy complained about him
to his parents.

01:28:19.614 --> 01:28:24.484
When they asked him the next day,
he hit that boy too.

01:28:25.484 --> 01:28:28.824
Do you know how my hand
burns when he hits me?

01:28:30.274 --> 01:28:32.174
Why didn't you complain
to the school authorities?

01:28:34.204 --> 01:28:37.104
Don't cry.
- Everyone is scared of him.

01:28:37.694 --> 01:28:38.694
Did you tell mom?

01:28:39.164 --> 01:28:41.194
She is already upset.

01:28:41.714 --> 01:28:43.654
How can I tell her?

01:28:44.674 --> 01:28:45.634
Get up.

01:28:45.804 --> 01:28:47.274
Where?
- Get up.

01:28:47.754 --> 01:28:49.014
Come with me.

01:28:49.754 --> 01:28:51.534
Students.
- Yes, sir.

01:28:51.764 --> 01:28:53.374
I asked you to do your homework.

01:28:53.464 --> 01:28:55.154
Yes, sir.
- Did you do your homework?

01:28:55.174 --> 01:28:57.234
No, sir.
- Why didn't you do it?

01:28:57.414 --> 01:28:59.444
Why won't you do your homework?
- He is the one.

01:28:59.524 --> 01:29:03.024
I asked you to do your homework.
Why didn't anyone do it?

01:29:03.304 --> 01:29:06.064
What are you thinking?
- Excuse me, sir.

01:29:07.274 --> 01:29:08.444
Can you come out for a minute?

01:29:11.934 --> 01:29:12.774
Tell me, sir.

01:29:13.744 --> 01:29:15.094
Why did you hit Divi?

01:29:16.454 --> 01:29:17.334
What did she do?

01:29:21.994 --> 01:29:23.564
You expect us
not to hit the students.

01:29:23.674 --> 01:29:25.164
But you expect them to behave.

01:29:25.294 --> 01:29:26.604
They will change
only if you hit them.

01:29:26.944 --> 01:29:28.654
You hit her so badly
that it has scarred.

01:29:29.214 --> 01:29:30.524
What did she do wrong?

01:29:33.594 --> 01:29:35.474
Is this how you treat children?

01:29:35.974 --> 01:29:36.964
Are you threatening me?

01:29:37.404 --> 01:29:39.774
Are you telling me
how to do my work?

01:29:44.354 --> 01:29:45.274
Look at her, sir.

01:29:45.474 --> 01:29:47.154
She is scared of you.

01:29:47.864 --> 01:29:51.354
Punishment is a method
of rectifying their mistakes.

01:29:51.814 --> 01:29:53.694
If you have to resort to violence

01:29:54.934 --> 01:29:56.774
then you're also wrong.
- Hello.

01:29:57.034 --> 01:29:59.154
Who are you?
Why are you asking me all this?

01:29:59.464 --> 01:30:00.954
Are you her father or mother?

01:30:01.124 --> 01:30:02.064
Oh.

01:30:02.874 --> 01:30:04.614
Only her parents
can question you, is it?

01:30:05.294 --> 01:30:07.514
What if it's her sister?

01:30:11.674 --> 01:30:12.604
Reena.

01:30:20.674 --> 01:30:23.234
How dare you hit me!
You hit me!

01:30:23.854 --> 01:30:24.844
What can I do, sir?

01:30:25.234 --> 01:30:26.644
You will change only if I hit you.

01:30:30.594 --> 01:30:34.194
How could you come to a school
and hit a teacher?

01:30:34.444 --> 01:30:36.684
You should've come to the office
and filed a complaint.

01:30:36.894 --> 01:30:38.754
Divi, you could have told us, right?

01:30:38.914 --> 01:30:42.054
How would she tell you?
She is so scared to talk about him.

01:30:42.244 --> 01:30:44.034
He hit the students so badly.

01:30:44.114 --> 01:30:45.764
Why haven't you taken
any action against him?

01:30:46.164 --> 01:30:47.564
Who are you?

01:30:47.884 --> 01:30:50.404
How are you related to Divi?
Where are her parents?

01:30:50.574 --> 01:30:53.104
Don't you recognise me?
I came here when Sid had a problem.

01:30:53.634 --> 01:30:54.604
I am her sister.

01:30:54.764 --> 01:30:56.314
I came because our mother is busy.

01:30:56.474 --> 01:30:57.854
Is this your problem now?

01:30:58.864 --> 01:31:00.234
See, I understand.

01:31:00.344 --> 01:31:04.064
We don't encourage such things
to happen. - But it has happened.

01:31:05.104 --> 01:31:07.224
I don't know how many more
children are affected like this.

01:31:07.814 --> 01:31:10.904
If you don't dismiss him
and take proper action

01:31:11.464 --> 01:31:13.734
we will have to file a police
complaint and take action.

01:31:13.884 --> 01:31:16.814
Sir, I apologise to you
on behalf of the management.

01:31:17.694 --> 01:31:20.014
I will take action immediately.

01:31:23.154 --> 01:31:24.874
I didn't expect you to hit him.

01:31:25.994 --> 01:31:27.324
I got emotional, Arjun.

01:31:27.754 --> 01:31:28.984
I shouldn't have hit him, right?

01:31:30.544 --> 01:31:31.514
What you did was right.

01:31:33.294 --> 01:31:36.774
Look at Divi.
- He won't hit anyone now, right?

01:31:36.854 --> 01:31:38.754
You didn't hit the teacher
because you wanted to.

01:31:39.264 --> 01:31:42.024
But Divi won't get
scared of him, right?

01:31:46.404 --> 01:31:47.314
Thanks, Arjun.

01:31:53.494 --> 01:31:54.554
I need to talk to you.

01:31:59.974 --> 01:32:02.704
Why aren't you taking care of the
children because of your problem?

01:32:03.574 --> 01:32:04.954
Who said that I am not
taking care of them?

01:32:05.084 --> 01:32:06.624
How do you know what my problem is?

01:32:06.834 --> 01:32:08.834
Why should the children
get affected because of you?

01:32:09.084 --> 01:32:10.574
How did they get affected?

01:32:12.124 --> 01:32:13.964
Divi has been dull since
she came back from school.

01:32:14.034 --> 01:32:14.944
Did you notice that?

01:32:17.554 --> 01:32:20.174
She had a problem at school.
Did she tell you?

01:32:22.764 --> 01:32:24.714
What problem?
- Go and ask Divi.

01:32:27.484 --> 01:32:29.094
Reena, tell me what the problem is.

01:32:34.704 --> 01:32:36.944
So much has happened.
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

01:32:37.874 --> 01:32:39.274
You expect me to tell you?

01:32:40.294 --> 01:32:42.244
She didn't tell you or her father.

01:32:42.614 --> 01:32:44.364
But she told me even though
she is angry with me.

01:32:44.914 --> 01:32:47.184
Both of you are busy
trying to solve your problems.

01:32:48.374 --> 01:32:49.934
You are not even ready
to listen to this.

01:32:50.294 --> 01:32:51.554
Then how would she tell you?

01:32:55.584 --> 01:32:56.994
I understand your situation.

01:32:57.884 --> 01:33:00.324
You are talking about divorce
because he fought with you.

01:33:00.444 --> 01:33:01.564
I understand everything.

01:33:01.854 --> 01:33:03.524
But look at the kids.

01:33:04.474 --> 01:33:06.164
Talk to them for a while.

01:33:06.684 --> 01:33:08.084
Do I have ten hands?

01:33:08.524 --> 01:33:09.694
Do I look like ten people?

01:33:10.324 --> 01:33:13.774
I am trying to balance
everything in my life, Reena.

01:33:14.404 --> 01:33:15.314
I can't do it.

01:33:15.674 --> 01:33:17.154
But I am trying.

01:33:18.694 --> 01:33:20.364
Don't blame me.

01:33:21.074 --> 01:33:22.854
I am not blaming you.

01:33:23.864 --> 01:33:25.734
I am just concerned
about the children.

01:33:32.914 --> 01:33:34.084
Can we do something?

01:33:34.874 --> 01:33:35.814
What?

01:33:37.844 --> 01:33:40.404
Till you come back
from the hospital

01:33:41.884 --> 01:33:43.714
shall I take care
of the children at home?

01:33:45.874 --> 01:33:48.064
Only till you come back.
Whenever I log out early.

01:33:48.454 --> 01:33:51.314
I know how
to take care of my children.

01:33:51.684 --> 01:33:52.714
I don't need your help.

01:34:25.224 --> 01:34:26.564
What is it, Radhi?

01:34:29.564 --> 01:34:30.814
Why didn't you tell me?

01:34:33.474 --> 01:34:36.534
Your problem is bigger
than this wound.

01:34:37.234 --> 01:34:38.894
I am not a kid anymore.

01:34:43.534 --> 01:34:44.474
Sorry, Divi.

01:34:45.574 --> 01:34:47.164
I should have been more careful.

01:34:47.634 --> 01:34:48.654
It's okay.

01:34:48.734 --> 01:34:50.684
Reena took care of it.

01:34:52.534 --> 01:34:54.404
What are you going to do now?

01:34:57.634 --> 01:34:58.484
I don't know.

01:34:59.084 --> 01:35:00.094
We will take care of it.

01:35:01.604 --> 01:35:02.434
You sleep.

01:35:03.014 --> 01:35:05.274
Next time, you should
tell me if anything happens.

01:35:06.094 --> 01:35:07.304
Sleep now.
- Okay, Mom.

